      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to heat pump repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/heat-pump-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, you\u2019ll learn how to repair a heat pump from start to finish. We cover everything: shutting off power, inspecting for damage, testing and replacing key parts like capacitors and fuses, and cleaning coils and filters. You\u2019ll also see how to reassemble your system and check that it\u2019s working right in both heating and cooling modes. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, these clear steps will help you get your heat pump running efficiently again. Have questions or tips? Drop them in the comments! Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more helpful guides, and contractors\u2014check out Contractor Plus for the best tools in the business.",
