      name: "How to Repair a Burst Pipe: Step-by-Step Guide",
      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to burst pipe repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/burst-pipe-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, we show you exactly how to repair a burst copper pipe, from shutting off the water to installing a new section and testing for leaks. You'll learn what tools and materials you need, how to safely remove the damaged pipe, and the best way to make a lasting repair. We also cover tips to prevent future pipe bursts, like adding insulation. Whether you're a homeowner facing an emergency or a contractor looking for a quick refresher, this guide will help you get the job done right. If you found this helpful, please like and follow. Contractors, check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business!",
