      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to air duct sealing at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/air-duct-sealing/national-average\n\nIn this video, we show you step-by-step how to seal your air ducts to boost your home's energy efficiency and comfort. Learn how to inspect your ductwork, clean and prepare the area, apply mastic sealant or foil tape, insulate ducts, and test your HVAC system for leaks. We cover the essential materials you'll need, including mastic, foil tape, cleaning supplies, gloves, and drop cloths. Whether you're a homeowner or a contractor, these clear instructions will help you get the job done right. Have questions or tips? Drop them in the comments! Like and follow for more practical home improvement guides, and discover how Contractor Plus can help you run your contracting business smarter.",
