      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to replace gfci outlet at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/replace-gfci-outlet/national-average\n\nIn this video, you\u2019ll learn how to replace a GFCI outlet step-by-step, from turning off the power to testing your new installation. We\u2019ll cover the tools and materials you need, how to safely disconnect and reconnect wires, and how to make sure your new GFCI outlet is working properly. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, this guide will help you complete the job quickly and safely. Have questions or tips? Drop them in the comments! Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more DIY and contractor tips. Contractors\u2014discover how Contractor Plus can help you run your business smarter!",
