      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to pvc pipe repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/pvc-pipe-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, you'll learn exactly how to repair a damaged 2-inch PVC pipe, from shutting off the water to making clean cuts and sealing new joints. We break down each step, including what tools and materials you need, how long each part takes, and tips for a leak-free repair. Whether you're a homeowner tackling a DIY fix or a contractor looking for a quick refresher, this guide will help you get the job done right. Have questions or want more tips? Drop a comment below, like, and follow for more how-to videos. Contractors\u2014discover how Contractor Plus can streamline your business today!",
