        "Did you know hidden bathroom mold can ruin your home and your health? In this video, you'll learn step-by-step how to safely remove mold from your bathroom and keep it from coming back. \n\nFirst, get your gear ready: N95 masks, gloves, plastic sheeting, and painter\u2019s tape. Ventilate the bathroom, clear out all items, and seal off the area with plastic to stop mold spores from spreading.\n\nNext, scrub all visible mold from walls, ceilings, and fixtures using a mold remover solution and sturdy brushes. Rinse and dry every surface well.\n\nNow, go deeper. Apply a specialized mold remover or diluted bleach to all affected spots. Let it soak in, then scrub and wipe down again to make sure the mold is gone.\n\nFinally, dry the bathroom completely with fans or a dehumidifier. Check for hidden moisture, fix any leaks, and improve ventilation to stop mold from coming back.\n\nIf you liked this video, I appreciate the like and follow. If you're a contractor, come check out Contractor Plus. We've built the ultimate operating system for build and service contractors. Thanks for watching!",
