      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to toilet fitting at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/toilet-fitting/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn how to remove an old toilet and install a new one with clear, easy-to-follow steps. We\u2019ll cover everything from shutting off the water and disconnecting the old toilet, to prepping the area, setting the new wax ring, and securing your new toilet in place. You\u2019ll also see how to reconnect the water supply and check for leaks, ensuring a professional finish. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner tackling your first bathroom upgrade or a contractor looking for a quick refresher, this guide will help you get the job done right. Like and follow for more DIY and contractor tips, and let us know your questions in the comments!",
