      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to water heater pressure relief valve replacement at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/water-heater-pressure-relief-valve-replacement/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn how to safely replace a water heater pressure relief valve step by step. We\u2019ll cover how to shut off water and power, drain your water heater, remove the old valve, and install a new one using the right materials. You\u2019ll also learn how to test your new valve for leaks and proper operation. This guide is perfect for homeowners and contractors who want to keep their water heaters running safely and efficiently. Have questions or tips? Drop them in the comments! Don\u2019t forget to like, follow, and check out Contractor Plus for more pro tips and tools.",
