        "Calculate materials & costs to landscape lighting installation at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/landscape-lighting-installation/national-average\n\nIn this video, we walk you through the complete process of installing low-voltage landscape lighting. Learn how to plan your lighting layout, choose the right fixtures and materials, run wiring, and connect everything safely. We cover each step in detail\u2014from marking fixture locations and wiring, to testing and final adjustments\u2014so you can light up your yard with confidence. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner looking to boost curb appeal or a contractor seeking a reliable workflow, this guide will help you get professional results. Have questions or tips? Drop them in the comments, and don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more how-to videos!",
