      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to toilet drain at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/toilet-drain/national-average\n\nIn this video, you\u2019ll learn how to replace a toilet drain from start to finish. We\u2019ll cover how to safely remove your toilet, inspect and clean the drain, and reinstall everything for a leak-free result. Whether you\u2019re a DIY homeowner or a contractor, these clear steps will help you get the job done right. We\u2019ll also talk about the essential materials you\u2019ll need, like PVC pipes, wax rings, and primer. If you have questions or want more tips, drop a comment below. Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more how-to videos. Contractors\u2014discover how Contractor Plus can help you run your business smarter!",
