      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to install subpanel at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/install-subpanel/national-average\n\nIn this video, you\u2019ll learn exactly how to install a subpanel, from planning and shutting off power, to mounting, wiring, and final inspection. We\u2019ll cover the materials you need\u2014like subpanels, breakers, copper wire, conduit, and grounding kits\u2014and walk you through each step so you can do the job safely and up to code. Whether you\u2019re a contractor or a handy homeowner, this guide will help you expand your electrical system with confidence. Have questions or tips? Drop them in the comments! Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more how-to videos, and check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your contracting business.",
