        "Calculate materials & costs to hot water heater repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/hot-water-heater-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, we show you exactly how to repair a hot water heater, whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor. Learn how to safely shut off power and water, drain and inspect your heater, replace faulty parts like heating elements and thermostats, and test your system for leaks and proper operation. We break down each step so you can follow along and get your hot water running again quickly. If you found this guide helpful, please like and follow for more home repair tips. Contractors, don\u2019t forget to check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business. Drop your questions or experiences in the comments below!",
