        "Calculate materials & costs to install outdoor outlet at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/install-outdoor-outlet/national-average\n\nIn this video, we show you step-by-step how to install a safe, weatherproof outdoor electrical outlet. Learn how to plan your project, choose the right materials, cut and mount an exterior electrical box, run outdoor-rated wiring, and wire up a GFCI outlet with a weatherproof cover. We cover essential safety tips, code basics, and how to test your new outlet for proper operation. Whether you\u2019re a DIY homeowner or a pro contractor, this guide will help you get reliable outdoor power for your home or job site. Like and follow for more how-tos, and let us know your questions or tips in the comments!",
