      name: "How to Reset Your Garbage Disposal in Minutes",
      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to garbage disposal reset at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/garbage-disposal-reset/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn how to reset your garbage disposal quickly and safely. We\u2019ll walk you through every step, from turning off the power to pressing the reset button and testing your unit. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, these clear instructions will help you get your disposal running again without calling for expensive repairs. If your disposal still won\u2019t work after a reset, we\u2019ll let you know what to do next. Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more helpful home repair tips! Contractors, check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to manage your business. Drop your questions or experiences in the comments below!",
