      transcript:
        "Is your garbage disposal not working? You might just need a simple reset! \n\nIn this video, I\u2019ll show you how to safely reset your garbage disposal in just a few easy steps.\n\nFirst, safety is key. Turn off the disposal at the wall switch. If you can, unplug it under the sink, or switch off the circuit breaker. This keeps you safe while you work.\n\nNext, look under your sink for the disposal unit. Find the small red reset button on the bottom. Press it firmly until you feel or hear a click. That means it\u2019s reset.\n\nNow, restore power. Plug the unit back in or turn the breaker back on. Run cold water, then flip the wall switch to test the disposal. If it runs smoothly, you\u2019re all set!\n\nIf the button won\u2019t stay in or the disposal still doesn\u2019t work, you may need a new reset button or professional help.\n\nIf you liked this video, I appreciate the like and follow. If you're a contractor, come check out Contractor Plus. We've built the ultimate operating system for build and service contractors. Thanks for watching!",
