      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to water line repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/water-line-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, we break down exactly how to repair a leaking water line in your home or business. You'll learn how to safely shut off your water, locate and expose the damaged section, cut and replace the pipe using PEX and brass couplings, and test your repair for leaks. We also cover how to insulate and secure your new pipe, plus tips for cleaning up and restoring your space. Whether you're a DIY homeowner or a contractor looking for a refresher, this guide will help you tackle water line repairs with confidence. Like and follow for more how-to videos, and contractors\u2014discover how Contractor Plus can streamline your business today!",
