      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to popcorn ceiling removal at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/popcorn-ceiling-removal/national-average\n\nReady to update your home by removing that old popcorn ceiling? This video walks you through every step, from prepping your room and protecting your floors, to wetting and scraping the texture, repairing the surface, and finishing with primer and paint. Learn which tools and materials you\u2019ll need, how long each step takes, and get pro tips for a smooth, safe project. Whether you\u2019re a DIY homeowner or a contractor, you\u2019ll find clear instructions to get the job done right. Like and follow for more home improvement tips, and let us know your questions or experiences in the comments!",
