      name: "How to Repair Your Irrigation System: Step-by-Step Guide",
      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to irrigation system repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/irrigation-system-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, we walk you through a complete irrigation system repair, from inspection to final testing. Learn how to spot leaks, replace broken sprinkler heads, fix faulty valves, and repair damaged pipes using the right materials and tools. We\u2019ll show you how to flush lines, secure connections, and adjust spray patterns for perfect lawn coverage. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, these clear steps will help you restore your irrigation system quickly and efficiently. Have questions or tips? Drop them in the comments! Don\u2019t forget to like, follow, and check out Contractor Plus for more pro resources.",
