        "Calculate materials & costs to textured wall painting at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/textured-wall-painting/national-average\n\nReady to transform your space with textured wall painting? This video walks you through every step, from prepping your walls and applying joint compound, to priming, painting, and final cleanup. Learn exactly what materials you\u2019ll need, how much to buy for a 500 sq ft room, and the best techniques for a professional finish. Whether you\u2019re a DIY homeowner or a contractor, you\u2019ll get clear, practical tips to make your project a success. Have questions or want to share your results? Drop a comment below! Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more expert construction tips.",
