      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to replace sewer line at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/replace-sewer-line/national-average\n\nIn this video, we break down exactly how to replace a sewer line, from the first inspection to the final backfill. You'll learn how to assess your old line, get the right permits, safely excavate, and install new SDR-35 PVC pipe with all the right fittings and materials. We also cover how to ensure proper slope, secure joints, and pass inspection before restoring your yard. Whether you're a homeowner tackling a big DIY project or a contractor looking for a clear process, this guide will help you get the job done right. Like, follow, and let us know your questions in the comments!",
