      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to slab leak repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/slab-leak-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, we break down the entire slab leak repair process so you can tackle this critical plumbing issue with confidence. Learn how to detect a slab leak, prepare your work area, replace damaged copper pipes, and restore your flooring and concrete. We cover the tools and materials you\u2019ll need, including copper pipe, fittings, concrete patch, and leak detection kits. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, you\u2019ll get clear, actionable steps to ensure a safe and lasting repair. Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more expert construction tips, and check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your contracting business!",
