      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to clogged drain repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/clogged-drain-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, we show you exactly how to repair a clogged drain, whether you're a homeowner or a contractor. Learn how to assess the blockage, use a plunger and drain snake, apply drain cleaner, and even replace the P-trap if needed. We break down each step so you can confidently clear your sink or tub and avoid expensive plumbing bills. You'll also get tips on what tools and materials you need, how to test your work, and how to clean up safely. If you found this guide helpful, please like and follow for more DIY and contractor tips. Contractors, check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business!",
