      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to landscape grading at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/landscape-grading/national-average\n\nIn this video, we break down the complete process of landscape grading, so you can transform your yard for better drainage and a smoother lawn. Learn how to assess your site, plan your grading, clear and prepare the area, move and compact soil, and finish with a professional inspection. We cover essential materials like topsoil, fill dirt, landscape fabric, and grass seed or sod, plus tips for setting slopes and ensuring proper drainage. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, these clear steps will help you get the job done right. Like and follow for more practical construction tips, and visit Contractor Plus for the best tools to manage your projects!",
