      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to tankless water heater repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/tankless-water-heater-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, we show you exactly how to repair a tankless water heater, from diagnosing the problem to cleaning, replacing key parts, and testing your system. Learn how to safely shut down your unit, clean filters, descale the heat exchanger, and swap out faulty components like heating elements and sensors. We also cover how to reconnect everything, purge air, and check for leaks to ensure your hot water is back and reliable. Whether you're a homeowner or a contractor, these clear steps will help you get the job done right. Like and follow for more tips, and contractors\u2014discover how Contractor Plus can streamline your business!",
