      name: "How to Install a Curtain Rod: Step-by-Step Guide",
      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to curtain rod installation at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/curtain-rod-installation/national-average\n\nIn this video, we show you exactly how to install a curtain rod, from measuring and marking your wall to securely mounting brackets and hanging your curtains. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner looking to upgrade your space or a contractor wanting a quick refresher, this guide covers all the basics. We\u2019ll explain what tools and materials you need, how to ensure your rod is level, and tips for a sturdy, professional finish. If you find this helpful, please like and follow for more DIY and contractor tips. Contractors, don\u2019t forget to check out Contractor Plus\u2014the ultimate operating system for build and service pros. Drop your questions or share your own tips in the comments below!",
