      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to green roof installation at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/green-roof-installation/national-average\n\nIn this video, we break down the full process of installing a green roof, from site assessment to planting and maintenance. Learn how to check your roof\u2019s structure, install root barriers and drainage layers, add the right soil, and choose the best plants for your climate. We\u2019ll also cover installing irrigation and edge restraints to keep your green roof healthy and secure. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, this guide gives you the clear steps and tips you need to get the job done right. Like and follow for more how-to videos, and let us know your questions or experiences with green roofs in the comments!",
