      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to door knob installation at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/door-knob-installation/national-average\n\nIn this video, we show you exactly how to remove an old door knob and install a new one, even if you\u2019ve never done it before. We cover the tools and materials you\u2019ll need, including the door knob set, strike plate, and mounting screws. Follow along as we walk through each step: removing the old hardware, installing the new latch and knob, and testing for a perfect fit. This guide is perfect for homeowners looking to save money or contractors wanting a quick refresher. If you find this helpful, don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more DIY and contractor tips. Contractors, check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business!",
