        "Calculate materials & costs to drywall patching at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/drywall-patching/national-average\n\nIn this video, you'll learn how to patch drywall quickly and effectively, whether you're fixing a small hole or a larger damaged area. We cover everything from surface preparation and cutting out the damaged section, to applying the patch, joint compound, and sanding for a smooth finish. You'll also get tips on blending the repair so it disappears once painted. This guide is perfect for homeowners and contractors who want professional results without the guesswork. If you found this helpful, please like and follow for more DIY and contractor tips. Contractors, check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business!",
