      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to drywall replacement at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/drywall-replacement/national-average\n\nIn this video, we break down the entire drywall replacement process so you can tackle repairs with confidence. Learn how to safely remove damaged drywall, install new panels, tape and mud the joints, and finish with priming and painting for a seamless look. We cover essential materials, tools, and pro tips to help you avoid common mistakes and get professional results. Whether you're a homeowner or a contractor, this guide will help you save time and money on your next drywall project. If you found this helpful, please like and follow for more DIY and contractor tips. Contractors, check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business!",
