        "Calculate materials & costs to thermostat not working at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/thermostat-not-working/national-average\n\nIs your thermostat not responding or failing to control your heating and cooling? This video walks you through a simple, step-by-step process to diagnose and fix a thermostat that\u2019s not working. Learn how to check power, inspect wiring, replace batteries, and reset your thermostat for reliable operation. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, these tips will help you get your system running again fast. Have questions or want more tips? Drop a comment below, like, and follow for more home repair guides. Contractors\u2014discover how Contractor Plus can streamline your business today!",
