      transcript:
        "Is your thermostat not working and you\u2019re not sure what to do next? In this video, I\u2019ll show you how to troubleshoot and fix a broken thermostat step by step. \n\nFirst, check the basics. Make sure your thermostat is set to the right mode\u2014heat or cool\u2014and that it\u2019s powered on. Head to your breaker box and check for any tripped breakers or blown fuses. Reset them if needed.\n\nNext, remove the thermostat cover. Look at the wiring. Are any wires loose or corroded? Tighten loose connections and clean off any corrosion. If your thermostat uses batteries, swap them out for fresh ones. Make sure all wires are firmly attached before you put the cover back on.\n\nNow, reset your thermostat using the manufacturer\u2019s instructions. Test both the heating and cooling functions. Listen for your system to kick on and check if the temperature changes as expected.\n\nIf you liked this video, I appreciate the like and follow. If you're a contractor, come check out Contractor Plus. We've built the ultimate operating system for build and service contractors. Thanks for watching!",
