      transcript:
        "Want a perfect green lawn with zero mowing? Here\u2019s how to install artificial turf like a pro. In this video, you\u2019ll learn every step to transform your yard with turf, from prep to final cleanup.\n\nFirst, clear your site. Remove all grass, rocks, and debris. Dig down a few inches so your turf sits flush with walkways. Make sure the ground is level\u2014this is key for a smooth finish.\n\nNext, lay your base. Spread crushed rock or decomposed granite about 2\u20133 inches deep. Compact it well. Slope the base slightly for drainage, so water won\u2019t pool.\n\nNow, roll out your turf. Let it sit in the sun for a bit to relax. Trim the edges to fit your space. If you have seams, use seam tape and adhesive to join pieces. Secure the turf with landscape spikes every few feet around the edges.\n\nTime for infill. Spread sand or rubber infill evenly across the turf. Use a stiff broom to brush the fibers upright and work the infill in. This helps the turf look and feel real.\n\nFinally, inspect your work. Check seams and edges, then clean up any leftover materials. Your new turf is ready to enjoy!\n\nIf you liked this video, I appreciate the like and follow. If you're a contractor, come check out Contractor Plus. We've built the ultimate operating system for build and service contractors. Thanks for watching!",
