      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to tankless water heater maintenance at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/tankless-water-heater-maintenance/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn how to perform essential maintenance on your tankless water heater to keep it running efficiently and extend its lifespan. We\u2019ll walk you through every step, from powering down and shutting off water, to cleaning the inlet filter, flushing with descaling solution, and checking for leaks. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, these clear instructions will help you avoid costly repairs and enjoy reliable hot water. Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more helpful tips, and if you\u2019re a contractor, check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business!",
