      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to sprinkler head replacement at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/sprinkler-head-replacement/national-average\n\nIn this video, you\u2019ll learn how to replace a broken or malfunctioning sprinkler head quickly and easily. We\u2019ll walk you through every step, from shutting off your irrigation system and removing the old head, to installing a new one and testing for leaks. You\u2019ll also get tips on checking for damage, using Teflon tape to prevent leaks, and making sure your new sprinkler head works perfectly. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, this guide will help you save time and money on your next sprinkler repair. If you found this helpful, don\u2019t forget to like, follow, and share your own tips or questions in the comments!",
