        "Calculate materials & costs to fence repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/fence-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn how to repair a damaged fence from start to finish. We\u2019ll walk you through inspecting your fence, removing broken boards and posts, installing new materials, and applying a protective finish. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner tackling a DIY project or a contractor looking for a quick refresher, this guide covers all the basics\u2014tools, materials, and pro tips for a sturdy, great-looking fence. Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more helpful construction tips! Contractors, check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business. Drop your questions or share your fence repair stories in the comments below!",
