      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to garbage disposal repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/garbage-disposal-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, we show you exactly how to repair a garbage disposal safely and efficiently. Learn how to turn off the power, clear jams, inspect wiring, and fix leaks using simple tools and affordable materials. We\u2019ll walk you through each step, from troubleshooting with a hex key to replacing gaskets and splash guards. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, you\u2019ll get practical tips to restore your disposal\u2019s performance and prevent future problems. Have questions or tips of your own? Drop them in the comments! Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more helpful repair guides. Contractors\u2014discover how Contractor Plus can streamline your business today!",
