      transcript:
        "Want to make your roof look brand new without damaging it? In this video, I\u2019ll show you how to safely pressure wash your roof step by step. \n\nFirst, get your materials: rent a pressure washer, grab roof cleaner solution, plastic sheeting to protect landscaping, and a safety harness kit. \n\nStart with site prep. Clear the area around your house, cover plants with plastic sheeting, and make sure all windows and doors are closed. \n\nNext, set up safety. Place ladders or scaffolding securely. Put on your safety harness and check the roof for any damage or loose shingles before you start. \n\nNow, it\u2019s time to wash. Use the right nozzle and pressure setting for your roof type. Start at the top and work your way down. This keeps water from getting under the shingles. Take your time\u2014this step usually takes two to three hours for a 1,000 square foot roof. \n\nFinally, rinse the roof well. Check for any missed spots or damage. Remove the plastic sheeting from your landscaping. \n\nIf you liked this video, I appreciate the like and follow. If you're a contractor, come check out Contractor Plus. We've built the ultimate operating system for build and service contractors. Thanks for watching!",
