      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to sprinkler system repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/sprinkler-system-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, we walk you through the complete process of repairing a sprinkler system, from inspection to final testing. Learn how to spot common problems like broken sprinkler heads, leaky pipes, and faulty valves. We\u2019ll show you how to replace damaged parts, fix underground leaks, and adjust your system for the best coverage. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, these clear steps will help you get your irrigation system running smoothly again. Have questions or tips? Drop them in the comments! Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more helpful repair guides. Contractors\u2014discover how Contractor Plus can streamline your business today!",
