      name: "How to Replace a Fuse Box: Step-by-Step Guide",
      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to fuse box replacement at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/fuse-box-replacement/national-average\n\nIn this video, we break down the entire process of replacing a fuse box, from shutting off the main power to testing your new installation. You'll learn which materials you need\u2014like a 100-amp fuse box, circuit breakers, grounding bar, and more\u2014and how to use them safely and efficiently. We cover each step in detail, including labeling circuits, wiring, mounting, and final safety checks. Whether you're a homeowner tackling a DIY project or a contractor looking for a refresher, this guide will help you get the job done right. Have questions or tips? Drop them in the comments! Don\u2019t forget to like, follow, and check out Contractor Plus for more pro resources.",
      thumbnailUrl:
        "https://contractor-plus-website.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/og-images/f1ea6cea-9e31-4952-b7a4-9996c2cd4064.jpg",
      uploadDate: "2025-08-04",
      duration: "PT2M8S",
