      name: "How to Install Kitchen Cabinets Step by Step",
      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to install cabinet at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/install-cabinet/national-average\n\nReady to upgrade your kitchen with new cabinets? This video walks you through the entire cabinet installation process, from prepping your space and marking stud locations to mounting, aligning, and finishing your cabinets. Learn how to use ledger boards for support, secure cabinets to studs, align faces, and install hardware for a professional look. Whether you're a DIY homeowner or a contractor, these clear steps will help you achieve a flawless cabinet installation. Like and follow for more tips, and if you're a contractor, discover how Contractor Plus can streamline your business. Leave your questions or experiences in the comments below!",
