      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to artificial turf installation at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/artificial-turf-installation/national-average\n\nThinking about a low-maintenance, green lawn all year round? This video walks you through every step of artificial turf installation, from site prep to final grooming. Learn how to remove old grass, lay a solid base, install weed barrier, roll out and trim turf, secure seams, and apply infill for a professional finish. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, you\u2019ll get clear, easy-to-follow tips to ensure your turf looks great and lasts for years. Drop your questions in the comments, like and follow for more how-tos, and check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your contracting business!",
