      name: "How to Detect and Fix Gas Line Leaks Safely",
      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to gas line leak detection at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/gas-line-leak-detection/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn how to safely detect and repair gas line leaks in your home or job site. We\u2019ll walk you through every step, from shutting off the gas and ventilating the area, to using a gas leak detector solution or electronic meter. You\u2019ll see how to spot leaks, make repairs with the right tools, and verify your work for total safety. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, these tips will help you protect your property and loved ones. Have questions or want more tips? Drop a comment below, like, and follow for more how-to videos. Contractors\u2014discover how Contractor Plus can streamline your business today!",
      thumbnailUrl:
        "https://contractor-plus-website.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/og-images/fcdd725c-bb5e-4c18-a258-96a82888f2ef.jpg",
