      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to tile repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/tile-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, you\u2019ll learn how to repair a broken floor tile from start to finish. We cover everything: removing the damaged tile, prepping the surface, applying adhesive, installing the new tile, and finishing with grout and sealer. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner tackling a DIY project or a contractor looking for a quick refresher, this guide will help you get professional results. Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more tips, and if you\u2019re a contractor, check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business. Drop your questions or share your own tile repair tips in the comments below!",
