      name: "How to Winterize Your Sprinkler System Step by Step",
      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to sprinkler winterization at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/sprinkler-winterization/national-average\n\nIn this video, you\u2019ll learn exactly how to winterize your sprinkler system and protect it from freezing temperatures. We\u2019ll walk you through shutting off the water supply, blowing out the lines with an air compressor, and insulating key components to prevent costly winter damage. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, these clear steps will help you avoid expensive repairs and keep your irrigation system in top shape. Have questions or tips of your own? Drop them in the comments! Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more practical home and contractor guides.",
      thumbnailUrl:
        "https://contractor-plus-website.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/og-images/f6c8b572-a331-403a-8682-41bce8b8c90d.jpg",
      uploadDate: "2025-08-04",
      duration: "PT2M4S",
