      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to ceiling drywall repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/ceiling-drywall-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, you'll learn how to repair ceiling drywall from start to finish. We cover everything: prepping your space, removing damaged drywall, installing a new patch, taping and mudding seams, sanding for a smooth finish, and finally priming and painting. Whether you're a homeowner tackling a DIY project or a contractor looking for a quick refresher, this guide will help you get professional results. Have questions or tips? Drop them in the comments! Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more helpful construction tutorials. Contractors\u2014discover how Contractor Plus can streamline your business today!",
