      name: "How to Finish Drywall: Step-by-Step Guide for Smooth Walls",
      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to drywall finishing at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/drywall-finishing/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn how to finish drywall like a pro, from surface prep to the final sanding. We break down each step: prepping the drywall, taping seams, applying joint compound, sanding between coats, and getting your walls ready for paint. You\u2019ll also get a clear idea of the time and materials needed for a 1,000 sq ft project, including joint compound, tape, corner bead, sanding sponges, and primer. Whether you\u2019re a DIY homeowner or a contractor, these tips will help you achieve a smooth, professional finish. Like and follow for more construction tips, and let us know your drywall questions in the comments!",
