      "@type": "VideoObject",
      name: "How to Replace Garage Door Springs Safely & Easily",
      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to garage door spring replacement at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/garage-door-spring-replacement/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn how to safely replace garage door torsion springs step by step. We cover everything from disconnecting your opener and securing the door, to removing old springs, inspecting hardware, and installing new springs with the right tools. You\u2019ll see which materials you need, how to wind the springs correctly, and how to test your garage door for smooth operation. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, these tips will help you get the job done right and avoid common mistakes. Like and follow for more DIY and contractor tips, and check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business!",
      thumbnailUrl:
        "https://contractor-plus-website.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/og-images/cd07f061-6679-4949-a3e2-e79081d3a206.jpg",
