      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to mold inspection at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/mold-inspection/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn how to perform a thorough mold inspection in your home or property. We\u2019ll walk you through the essential tools you need, including mold test kits, PPE, moisture meters, and more. Follow our clear, step-by-step process: start with a visual assessment, use moisture detection tools, collect samples, and document your findings. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, this guide will help you spot mold early and know what to do next. Have questions or tips? Drop them in the comments! Don\u2019t forget to like, follow, and check out Contractor Plus for more resources and tools for contractors.",
