      transcript:
        "Did you know hidden mold can damage your home and your health? Today, I\u2019ll show you how to inspect for mold step by step, so you can catch problems early and keep your space safe. \n\nFirst, gather your supplies: three mold test kits, a set of personal protective equipment, a moisture meter (you can rent one), a flashlight, and five sample collection swabs. \n\nStart with an initial assessment. Spend 30 to 45 minutes checking basements, bathrooms, and around windows for visible mold, water stains, or musty smells. Use your flashlight to look in dark corners and behind furniture.\n\nNext, use the moisture meter to check walls, ceilings, and floors for hidden dampness. This takes about an hour. If you find suspicious spots, collect air or surface samples with your swabs and test kits for lab analysis.\n\nFinally, document everything. Take photos, write notes, and create a report. List the affected areas, possible causes, and what steps to take next.\n\nIf you liked this video, I appreciate the like and follow. If you're a contractor, come check out Contractor Plus. We've built the ultimate operating system for build and service contractors. Thanks for watching!",
