      "@type": "VideoObject",
      name: "How to Repair Drywall Tape: Step-by-Step Guide",
      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to drywall tape repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/drywall-tape-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, you\u2019ll learn how to repair drywall tape quickly and professionally. We\u2019ll cover everything from prepping the wall and removing damaged tape, to applying new tape, layering joint compound, and finishing with sanding and paint. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner tackling a DIY project or a contractor looking for a refresher, these clear steps will help you get a flawless finish every time. Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more helpful tips! Contractors, check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business. Drop your questions or share your own drywall repair tips in the comments below!",
      thumbnailUrl:
        "https://contractor-plus-website.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/og-images/66d3c1fc-20f3-425a-b4f8-504bdea5c43c.jpg",
      uploadDate: "2025-08-04",
      duration: "PT2M43S",
