      transcript:
        "Want to make your old door look brand new? Let\u2019s walk through how to paint a door like a pro, step by step. \n\nFirst, take the door off its hinges and remove all the hardware. Clean the door well\u2014dust, dirt, and grease can ruin your finish. Lay down a drop cloth to protect your floors.\n\nNext, sand the door with fine sandpaper to smooth out any bumps or old paint. Wipe away the dust. Now, grab your primer and apply a thin, even coat. This helps the paint stick and last longer. Let the primer dry completely.\n\nNow it\u2019s time to paint. Use a brush or roller to apply your door paint in thin, even layers. Don\u2019t overload your brush\u2014two light coats are better than one thick one. Let the paint dry fully between coats.\n\nOnce dry, reattach the hardware and hang the door back up. That\u2019s it\u2014your door is refreshed and ready to go!\n\nIf you liked this video, I appreciate the like and follow. If you're a contractor, come check out Contractor Plus. We've built the ultimate operating system for build and service contractors. Thanks for watching!",
