      name: "How to Prune a Tree: Tools, Steps & Pro Tips",
      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to tree pruning at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/tree-pruning/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn how to prune a tree safely and effectively, whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor. We cover the essential tools you\u2019ll need\u2014like pruning saws, loppers, and safety gear\u2014and walk you through each step: assessing the tree, making the right cuts, and cleaning up. Discover pro tips for shaping your tree and improving its health, plus how to dispose of branches the right way. If you want your trees to look great and stay healthy, this guide is for you. Like and follow for more DIY and contractor tips, and check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business!",
