      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to ceiling light installation at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/ceiling-light-installation/national-average\n\nIn this video, we show you exactly how to install a ceiling light fixture, whether you're replacing an old one or adding a new light to your room. You'll learn how to safely turn off the power, remove the old fixture, inspect your wiring, and install the new light step by step. We cover the tools and materials you'll need, including the right electrical box, wire connectors, and mounting hardware. This guide is perfect for homeowners and contractors who want a clear, easy-to-follow process. If you found this helpful, please like and follow for more DIY and contractor tips. Contractors, check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business!",
