      name: "How to Repair a Gas Water Heater: Step-by-Step Guide",
      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to gas water heater repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/gas-water-heater-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, we walk you through the essential steps to repair a gas water heater, from shutting off utilities and draining the tank, to inspecting and replacing faulty parts like the thermocouple and gas control valve. You'll learn how to safely reassemble your heater, relight the pilot, and check for leaks to ensure everything works as it should. Whether you're a homeowner tackling a DIY fix or a contractor looking for a quick refresher, this guide covers what you need to know. Have questions or tips? Drop them in the comments! Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more practical repair guides. Contractors\u2014discover how Contractor Plus can streamline your business today!",
