      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to drywall installation at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/drywall-installation/national-average\n\nIn this video, we break down the complete drywall installation process, from site prep to a smooth, paint-ready finish. Learn how to measure and mark your walls, cut and hang drywall sheets, apply joint tape and compound, and sand for a flawless look. We cover the essential materials you\u2019ll need\u2014like drywall sheets, joint compound, screws, tape, and corner bead\u2014plus tips for working efficiently and getting professional results. Whether you\u2019re a DIY homeowner or a contractor looking to refresh your skills, this guide will help you tackle your next drywall project with confidence. Like and follow for more how-to videos, and let us know your drywall questions in the comments!",
