      transcript:
        "Want smooth, flawless walls? Here\u2019s how to install drywall like a pro. \n\nIn this video, you\u2019ll learn every step to hang, tape, and finish drywall for a perfect result.\n\nFirst, prep your site. Clear the area, gather your drywall sheets, joint compound, screws, tape, and corner bead. Measure your walls and mark the studs. This makes hanging drywall much easier.\n\nNext, hang the drywall sheets. Cut panels to fit, then lift and fasten them to the studs and ceiling joists. Use drywall screws every 12 to 16 inches for a secure hold.\n\nNow, it\u2019s time for taping and mudding. Apply paper tape over all seams. Cover with joint compound, feathering the edges. Let it dry, then add a second and third coat, letting each dry fully.\n\nOnce dry, sand the joints and screw holes until smooth. Touch up any rough spots. Clean up all dust before painting or texturing.\n\nIf you liked this video, I appreciate the like and follow. If you're a contractor, come check out Contractor Plus. We've built the ultimate operating system for build and service contractors. Thanks for watching!",
