      name: "How to Replace Ductwork: Step-by-Step Guide for Contractors",
      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to ductwork replacement at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/ductwork-replacement/national-average\n\nIn this video, we break down the entire ductwork replacement process, perfect for contractors and DIY homeowners. Learn how to assess your current system, safely remove old ducts, and install new galvanized steel ductwork with proper sealing and insulation. We also cover system testing, balancing airflow, and final inspection tips to ensure your project meets local codes and delivers top performance. Whether you're upgrading for better efficiency or tackling a renovation, this guide gives you the clear steps and pro tips you need. Like, follow, and share your questions or experiences in the comments. For contractors, discover how Contractor Plus can streamline your business today!",
