      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to roof drip edge installation at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/roof-drip-edge-installation/national-average\n\nIn this video, we show you step-by-step how to install a roof drip edge to protect your home from water damage. Learn how to remove old materials, inspect and prep your roof edge, measure and cut aluminum drip edge, and secure it with roofing nails for a professional finish. We cover the tools and materials you\u2019ll need, plus tips for overlapping joints and meeting building codes. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, this guide will help you get the job done right. Like and follow for more roofing tips, and check out Contractor Plus for the best contractor tools and resources!",
