      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to sprinkler valve replacement at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/sprinkler-valve-replacement/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn how to replace a faulty sprinkler valve quickly and safely. We\u2019ll walk you through every step: shutting off the water, removing the old valve, prepping and installing the new one, and testing your system for leaks. You\u2019ll also get tips on the right materials\u2014like PVC pipe, couplings, primer, and Teflon tape\u2014so you can do the job right the first time. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, this guide will help you restore your irrigation system and keep your lawn healthy. If you found this helpful, please like and follow for more DIY and contractor tips. Contractors, check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business!",
