      name: "How to Safely Remove Mold: Step-by-Step Mitigation Guide",
      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to mold mitigation at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/mold-mitigation/national-average\n\nIn this video, we break down the essential steps for effective mold mitigation in your home or job site. Learn how to assess mold damage, set up containment, safely remove contaminated materials, and thoroughly clean and dry the area to prevent future mold growth. We cover the must-have materials\u2014like mold remover, HEPA air scrubbers, and protective gear\u2014and explain how to use them for best results. Whether you're a homeowner tackling a mold problem or a contractor looking for a reliable process, this guide will help you get the job done right. Like and follow for more tips, and visit Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your contracting business!",
