      transcript:
        "Did you know hidden mold can destroy your home and your health? In this video, you'll learn how to safely tackle mold mitigation step by step. \n\nFirst, assess the affected area. Inspect every corner for mold and moisture. Once you spot the problem, set up containment barriers using 6 mil plastic sheeting. This keeps mold spores from spreading to clean areas.\n\nNext, suit up with N95 respirators, protective coveralls, and nitrile gloves. Remove all contaminated materials\u2014like drywall, insulation, or carpet. Bag everything in heavy-duty trash bags and seal them tight before disposal.\n\nNow, it's time to clean. Use a HEPA vacuum on all surfaces, then scrub with a mold remover solution. Make sure you get every nook and cranny.\n\nAfter cleaning, set up HEPA air scrubbers, air movers, and dehumidifiers. Let them run until the area is completely dry. This step is key to stopping mold from coming back.\n\nIf you liked this video, I appreciate the like and follow. If you're a contractor, come check out Contractor Plus. We've built the ultimate operating system for build and service contractors. Thanks for watching!",
