      name: "Hot Water Heater Maintenance: Step-by-Step Guide",
      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to hot water heater maintenance at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/hot-water-heater-maintenance/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn how to perform essential hot water heater maintenance to extend the life of your unit and avoid costly repairs. We\u2019ll walk you through turning off the power and water, draining and flushing the tank, inspecting and replacing key parts like the anode rod and T&P relief valve, and testing your system for safe operation. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, these clear steps will help you keep your water heater running efficiently. Drop your questions or tips in the comments, and don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more practical home maintenance guides!",
