      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to repair gfci outlet at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/repair-gfci-outlet/national-average\n\nIn this video, you\u2019ll learn step-by-step how to repair or replace a faulty GFCI outlet in your home or job site. We\u2019ll cover how to safely turn off power, inspect for damage, test the outlet, and make secure wire connections. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, you\u2019ll get clear instructions on using the right materials\u2014like GFCI outlets, cover plates, wire connectors, and electrical tape. By the end, you\u2019ll know how to restore power and test your work for safety. Have questions or tips? Drop them in the comments! Don\u2019t forget to like, follow, and check out Contractor Plus for more pro tips and tools.",
