      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to brick repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/brick-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, you\u2019ll learn exactly how to repair damaged bricks and restore your wall\u2019s strength and appearance. We\u2019ll cover every step, from preparing your work area and removing old bricks, to mixing mortar, setting new bricks, and finishing the joints for a seamless look. You\u2019ll also get tips on curing and inspecting your repair for lasting results. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner tackling a DIY project or a contractor looking for a refresher, this guide will help you get the job done right. Don\u2019t forget to like, follow, and check out Contractor Plus for more tools and resources for contractors!",
