      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to window seal repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/window-seal-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn how to repair a window seal quickly and effectively, whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor. We\u2019ll walk you through inspecting the window, removing old caulk, applying new sealant, and ensuring a perfect finish. You\u2019ll discover which materials you need, how to prep the area, and tips for a smooth, long-lasting seal. Proper window seal repair can help prevent drafts, reduce energy bills, and protect your home from moisture damage. If you found this guide helpful, don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more DIY and contractor tips. Contractors, check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business!",
