      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to gas line capping at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/gas-line-capping/national-average\n\nIn this video, we show you how to safely cap a gas line in just a few simple steps. Learn how to shut off the gas, disconnect appliances, apply sealant, and install a gas pipe cap. We also cover how to test for leaks and make sure your work meets local safety codes. Whether you're a homeowner tackling a small project or a contractor looking for a quick refresher, this guide will help you avoid common mistakes and keep your property safe. If you found this video helpful, please like and follow for more tips. Contractors, check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business!",
