      name: "How to Wire a Hot Tub: Step-by-Step Electrical Guide",
      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to hot tub electrical wiring at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/hot-tub-electrical-wiring/national-average\n\nIn this video, we break down the complete process for wiring a hot tub safely and up to code. Learn how to plan your project, choose the right materials, install conduit, pull wires, and set up a GFCI spa panel. We\u2019ll also cover the importance of permits and inspections, so you avoid costly mistakes and stay safe. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, these clear steps will help you tackle your hot tub electrical wiring project with confidence. Have questions or tips? Drop them in the comments, and don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more how-to guides!",
