      name: "How to Inspect Your Roof: Step-by-Step Guide",
      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to roof inspection at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/roof-inspection/national-average\n\nIn this video, you\u2019ll learn how to perform a thorough roof inspection, whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor. We\u2019ll cover the essential tools you need, safety tips, and a step-by-step process to check for damage, leaks, and drainage issues. You\u2019ll see how to spot common problems like missing shingles, worn flashing, and clogged gutters. Plus, we\u2019ll show you how to document your findings and make smart recommendations for repairs. If you want to protect your home and avoid costly surprises, this guide is for you. Don\u2019t forget to like, follow, and share your own roof inspection tips in the comments!",
