      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to dryer vent replacement at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/dryer-vent-replacement/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn how to replace a dryer vent safely and efficiently. We\u2019ll walk you through disconnecting the old vent, installing a new flexible aluminum duct, securing it with clamps, and fitting a new exterior vent hood. You\u2019ll also see how to check for proper airflow and clean up the area when you\u2019re done. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, these clear steps will help you avoid common mistakes and keep your laundry area safe. Have questions or tips? Drop them in the comments! Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more practical home improvement guides.",
