      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to walk-in shower installation at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/walk-in-shower-installation/national-average\n\nReady to upgrade your bathroom? This video walks you through the full process of installing a walk-in shower, from demolition to the final touches. Learn how to prep your space, handle plumbing and waterproofing, install wall panels or tile, and set up fixtures and glass doors. We break down each step so you can tackle the job with confidence, whether you\u2019re a DIY homeowner or a pro contractor. Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more tips, and check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your contracting business. Drop your questions or experiences in the comments below!",
