      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to ductwork cleaning at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/ductwork-cleaning/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn how to clean your home\u2019s ductwork like a pro. We break down each step, from system inspection and preparation, to using HEPA vacuums and duct brushes, to reassembling and testing your HVAC system. You\u2019ll discover what materials you need, how long the process takes, and tips to keep your air clean and your system running efficiently. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner looking to improve air quality or a contractor wanting a refresher, this guide covers everything you need. Don\u2019t forget to like, follow, and check out Contractor Plus for more resources and tools for contractors!",
