      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to gutter caulking at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/gutter-caulking/national-average\n\nIn this video, we show you how to caulk your gutters step by step, so you can stop leaks and protect your home from water damage. Learn how to clean and inspect your gutters, apply gutter sealant, and test for leaks like a pro. We cover the tools and materials you\u2019ll need, including gutter caulk, gloves, rags, and mineral spirits for cleanup. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, these tips will help you get a watertight finish that lasts. Got questions or tips of your own? Drop them in the comments! Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more DIY and contractor how-tos.",
