      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to garage door cable replacement at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/garage-door-cable-replacement/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn how to replace your garage door cables safely and efficiently. We\u2019ll walk you through every step, from disconnecting the opener and securing the door, to removing old cables, inspecting hardware, and installing new lift cables. You\u2019ll also get tips on restoring spring tension and testing your door for smooth, balanced operation. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, this guide will help you avoid common mistakes and get the job done right. Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more DIY and contractor tips! Contractors\u2014discover how Contractor Plus can streamline your business operations today.",
