      name: "How to Lay Sod for a Lush Lawn: Step-by-Step Guide",
      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to lay sod at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/lay-sod/national-average\n\nReady for a green lawn in just one day? This video walks you through every step of laying sod, from prepping your yard to watering and first mow. Learn how to clear old grass, level and grade the soil, lay sod pieces tightly, and care for your new lawn so it roots fast and stays healthy. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, these tips will help you get professional results. Have questions or want more lawn care tips? Drop a comment below, like, and follow for more how-to videos. Contractors\u2014discover how Contractor Plus can help you manage every job with ease!",
