      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to toilet flush valve installation at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/toilet-flush-valve-installation/national-average\n\nIn this video, you'll learn how to replace a toilet flush valve quickly and easily, whether you're a homeowner or a contractor. We cover every step, from shutting off the water and draining the tank, to removing the old flush valve, installing the new one, and testing for leaks. You'll also find out what materials you need, like a flush valve kit, wax ring, and supply line. This guide is perfect for anyone looking to fix a running toilet, stop leaks, or improve water efficiency. If you found this helpful, please like and follow for more DIY and contractor tips. Contractors, check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business!",
