      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to pipe soldering at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/pipe-soldering/national-average\n\nIn this video, we show you exactly how to solder copper pipes for a leak-free, professional finish. You'll learn how to prepare your workspace, cut and clean pipes, apply flux, assemble fittings, and solder joints safely and effectively. We also cover how to test your work for leaks and clean up the job site. Whether you're a DIY homeowner or a contractor looking to brush up on your skills, this guide will help you get the job done right. Have questions or tips? Drop them in the comments, and don't forget to like and follow for more how-to videos. Contractors\u2014discover how Contractor Plus can streamline your business today!",
