      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to electrical panel upgrade at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/electrical-panel-upgrade/national-average\n\nUpgrading your electrical panel is a smart way to boost your home\u2019s safety and power capacity. In this video, we break down the entire process\u2014from shutting off the main power and removing the old panel, to installing a new 200 amp panel, connecting wires, and labeling breakers. We\u2019ll cover the essential materials you\u2019ll need, how long each step takes, and the importance of following local codes and scheduling inspections. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, you\u2019ll get clear, practical tips to make your panel upgrade smooth and safe. Got questions or tips? Drop them in the comments! Don\u2019t forget to like, follow, and check out Contractor Plus for more pro resources.",
