      name: "How to Repair a Drywall Hole Like a Pro",
      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to drywall hole repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/drywall-hole-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, you\u2019ll learn how to repair a hole in drywall step-by-step, using simple tools and materials. We\u2019ll cover everything from prepping the area and cutting a patch, to applying joint compound, sanding, and finishing with primer and paint. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner tackling a DIY project or a contractor looking for a quick refresher, this guide will help you achieve a seamless repair that blends right in. Have questions or tips of your own? Drop them in the comments! Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more practical repair tutorials. Contractors, check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business.",
