      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to gutter sealing at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/gutter-sealing/national-average\n\nIn this video, we show you exactly how to seal your gutters and stop leaks before they cause damage. You'll learn what tools and materials you need, how to clean and prep your gutters, and the best way to apply gutter sealant for a long-lasting fix. We break down each step, from inspection and cleaning to applying sealant and checking your work. Whether you're a homeowner or a contractor, these tips will help you get the job done right. Have questions or want to share your own gutter sealing tips? Drop a comment below! Don\u2019t forget to like, follow, and check out Contractor Plus for more pro resources.",
