      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to holiday light at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/holiday-light/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn step-by-step how to plan, prepare, and install holiday lights on your home or business. We cover everything from measuring your space and choosing the right LED lights, to testing, hanging, and powering your decorations safely. Discover tips for using extension cords, light clips, and outdoor timers to make your holiday display shine bright and stay safe. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, these clear instructions will help you get the job done right. Like and follow for more helpful guides, and contractors\u2014check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business!",
