      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to door sweep installation at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/door-sweep-installation/national-average\n\nIn this video, we show you how to install a door sweep to block drafts, save energy, and keep your home comfortable. You\u2019ll learn how to measure your door, choose the right sweep, remove any old hardware, and install the new sweep for a tight seal. We break down each step so you can do it yourself in under 30 minutes, using simple tools and affordable materials. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, this guide will help you get professional results. Have questions or tips? Drop them in the comments! Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more DIY and contractor tips.",
