      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to dryer vent repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/dryer-vent-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, we show you how to repair a dryer vent in just a few easy steps. Learn how to unplug and inspect your dryer vent, clean out lint and blockages, replace damaged parts, and reattach everything for safe, efficient drying. We cover the essential tools and materials you\u2019ll need, including flexible vent duct, exterior vent hood, duct clamps, foil tape, and screws. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner looking to save money or a contractor wanting to deliver top-notch service, this guide will help you get the job done right. Have questions or tips? Drop them in the comments, and don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more helpful how-to videos!",
