      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to door jamb repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/door-jamb-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn how to repair a damaged door jamb quickly and easily. We\u2019ll walk you through inspecting for damage, removing broken wood, cutting and installing new jamb pieces, and finishing the repair with wood filler and paint. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, these clear steps will help you restore your door frame so your door works smoothly again. Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more DIY and contractor tips! If you\u2019re a pro, check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business. Drop your questions or share your own repair tips in the comments below!",
