      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to fire alarm installation at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/fire-alarm-installation/national-average\n\nIn this video, we walk you through the complete process of installing fire alarms in your home or building. Learn how to assess your site, choose the right locations, gather all necessary materials, and install both hardwired and battery-powered alarms. We cover wiring, mounting, testing, and even how to educate users on maintenance and safety. Whether you're a homeowner or a contractor, this guide will help you ensure your fire alarm system is safe, reliable, and up to code. Have questions or tips? Drop them in the comments, and don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more expert construction advice!",
