      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to plaster wall repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/plaster-wall-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, you\u2019ll learn how to repair damaged plaster walls from start to finish. We\u2019ll cover everything you need to know, including prepping the area, patching holes and cracks, sanding for a smooth finish, and priming and painting for a seamless look. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner tackling a DIY project or a contractor looking for a refresher, this guide will help you get professional results. Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more helpful tips, and if you\u2019re a contractor, check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business. Drop your questions or share your own plaster repair tips in the comments below!",
