      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to drain trap replacement at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/drain-trap-replacement/national-average\n\nIn this video, you'll learn how to replace a drain trap under your sink, whether you're a DIY homeowner or a professional contractor. We cover every step, from shutting off the water and prepping your workspace, to removing the old trap and installing a new one with the right materials. You'll see which tools and parts you need, how to avoid leaks, and tips for a clean, secure fit. This guide is perfect for anyone looking to fix a leaky or clogged drain trap quickly and confidently. If you found this helpful, please like and follow for more home repair tips. Contractors, discover how Contractor Plus can streamline your business today!",
