      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to bathtub repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/bathtub-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, we show you exactly how to repair chips and cracks in your bathtub using simple tools and a repair epoxy kit. You'll learn how to prep the surface, apply the repair compound, and finish the job so your tub looks like new. Whether you're a homeowner tackling a DIY project or a contractor looking for a quick refresher, this guide covers everything you need to know. Have questions or want to share your own tips? Drop a comment below! Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more home repair tutorials. Contractors\u2014discover how Contractor Plus can streamline your business today!",
