      "@type": "VideoObject",
      name: "How to Clean Up Mold Safely: Step-by-Step Guide",
      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to mold cleanup at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/mold-cleanup/national-average\n\nIn this video, we break down the essential steps for safe and effective mold cleanup in your home or job site. Learn how to assess mold damage, gather the right protective gear and cleaning supplies, and set up containment to prevent mold spores from spreading. We\u2019ll show you how to scrub surfaces, remove contaminated materials, and use a HEPA vacuum for a thorough clean. Plus, discover tips for drying out the area and preventing future mold growth. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, these clear instructions will help you tackle mold safely and confidently. Like, follow, and share your questions or experiences in the comments!",
