      embedUrl:
        "https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/mold-cleanup/national-average",
      transcript:
        "Did you know hidden mold can ruin your home and your health? In this video, you'll learn how to safely clean up mold step by step, just like the pros. \n\nFirst, assess the area. Inspect every spot where you see or smell mold. Wear N95 respirators, gloves, and goggles. Gather your supplies: mold remover, scrub brushes, plastic sheeting, and heavy-duty trash bags. Seal off the work area with plastic sheeting to keep spores from spreading.\n\nNext, start the cleanup. Scrub all hard surfaces with mold remover and water. For porous items like drywall or carpet, remove and bag them\u2014they can't be saved. Use a HEPA vacuum on all cleaned surfaces to catch any leftover spores.\n\nNow, dry the area completely. Use fans or a dehumidifier. Fix any leaks and improve ventilation to stop mold from coming back.\n\nIf you liked this video, I appreciate the like and follow. If you're a contractor, come check out Contractor Plus. We've built the ultimate operating system for build and service contractors. Thanks for watching!",
