        "Calculate materials & costs to brick mortar repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/brick-mortar-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn how to repair brick mortar joints the right way, from surface prep to finishing touches. We\u2019ll cover the tools and materials you need, including mortar mix, replacement bricks, bonding agent, and more. Follow along as we walk through cleaning out old mortar, mixing and applying new mortar, and ensuring a strong, lasting repair. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner tackling a DIY project or a contractor looking for a refresher, this guide will help you get professional results. Have questions or tips? Drop them in the comments, and don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more construction how-tos!",
