      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to drywall repair and painting at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/drywall-repair-and-painting/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn how to repair damaged drywall and achieve a professional paint finish in just a few simple steps. We\u2019ll cover everything from prepping your space and patching holes, to sanding, priming, and painting for a seamless look. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner tackling a DIY project or a contractor looking for a refresher, this guide breaks down the process so anyone can follow along. Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more helpful tips, and if you\u2019re a contractor, check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business. Drop your questions or share your own drywall tips in the comments below!",
