      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to kitchen drain repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/kitchen-drain-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, we show you exactly how to repair a kitchen drain, from start to finish. You'll learn how to inspect for leaks, remove and clean the P-trap and pipes, and reassemble everything for a leak-free result. We cover the essential tools and materials you'll need, including PVC pipes, fittings, and plumber\u2019s putty. Whether you're a homeowner tackling a DIY project or a contractor looking for a quick refresher, this guide will help you get the job done right. Have questions or tips? Drop them in the comments! Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more practical repair guides and contractor tips.",
