      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to gutter inspection at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/gutter-inspection/national-average\n\nIn this video, you\u2019ll learn how to inspect your gutters like a pro. We\u2019ll walk you through the essential tools you need, how to set up your ladder safely, and the best way to check for damage and remove debris. You\u2019ll also see how to flush your gutters and test for leaks or blockages, so you can spot problems before they turn into costly repairs. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, these tips will help you keep your gutters in top shape. If you found this guide helpful, please like and follow for more home maintenance tips. Contractors, don\u2019t forget to check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business!",
