      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to bathtub surround repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/bathtub-surround-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, we walk you through the complete process of repairing or replacing a bathtub surround. You'll learn how to safely remove damaged panels, prepare your wall for installation, fit and secure new surround panels, and finish the job with proper sealing and fixture reinstallation. Whether you're a DIY homeowner or a professional contractor, these clear steps will help you achieve a watertight, long-lasting result. Have questions or tips to share? Drop them in the comments! Like and follow for more practical home improvement guides, and contractors\u2014discover how Contractor Plus can streamline your business today.",
