      name: "Thermostat Troubleshooting: Step-by-Step Guide for Homeowners",
      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to thermostat troubleshooting at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/thermostat-troubleshooting/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn how to troubleshoot a faulty thermostat in just a few easy steps. We\u2019ll walk you through checking for power, replacing batteries, inspecting and tightening wiring connections, and testing your system to make sure your heating or cooling works as it should. You\u2019ll also find out when it\u2019s time to replace your thermostat. This guide is perfect for homeowners and contractors who want to save time and money by fixing common thermostat issues themselves. If you found this video helpful, please like and follow for more tips. Contractors, don\u2019t forget to check out Contractor Plus\u2014the ultimate operating system for build and service contractors. Drop your questions or experiences in the comments below!",
