      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to thermostat not heating at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/thermostat-not-heating/national-average\n\nIs your home chilly even though the thermostat is set to heat? In this video, we walk you through the exact steps to troubleshoot and fix a thermostat that isn\u2019t heating. Learn how to check for power, inspect your circuit breaker and furnace, and test the thermostat wiring. We\u2019ll also cover when it\u2019s time to replace your thermostat or call a professional. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, these clear instructions will help you get your heating system back on track. If you found this guide helpful, don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more tips. Contractors, discover how Contractor Plus can streamline your business today!",
