      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to drip irrigation installation at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/drip-irrigation-installation/national-average\n\nIn this video, we walk you through the complete process of installing a drip irrigation system for your garden or landscape. Learn how to plan your layout, choose the right materials, assemble the tubing and emitters, and test your system for leaks and coverage. We cover every step, from measuring your space to final cleanup, so you can save water and keep your plants healthy. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, these tips will help you get professional results. Have questions or want to share your experience? Drop a comment below, like, and follow for more helpful guides!",
