      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to install sump pump discharge pipe at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/install-sump-pump-discharge-pipe/national-average\n\nIn this video, you'll learn how to install a sump pump discharge pipe from start to finish. We cover planning the discharge route, cutting and assembling PVC pipe, drilling the exterior exit, connecting and securing the pipe, and testing the system for leaks. Whether you're a homeowner or a contractor, these clear steps will help you keep your basement dry and protect your foundation from water damage. Have questions or tips? Drop them in the comments! Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more DIY and contractor guides. Contractors, check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business.",
