      name: "How to Repair a Stone Walkway: Step-by-Step Guide",
      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to stone walkway repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/stone-walkway-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, we show you exactly how to repair a stone walkway, from assessing damage to resetting stones and finishing the job. You'll learn how to spot problem areas, remove and clean damaged stones, rebuild the gravel base, and fill joints with the right materials. We break down each step so you can get professional results, whether you're a homeowner or a contractor. Have questions or tips about walkway repairs? Drop them in the comments! Like and follow for more practical construction guides, and if you're a contractor, check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business.",
