        "Calculate materials & costs to gate latch repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/gate-latch-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, we show you how to repair or replace a broken gate latch quickly and easily. You\u2019ll learn how to inspect your gate latch for damage, remove and clean the latch, fix or replace any broken parts, and reinstall it for smooth operation. We cover the tools and materials you\u2019ll need, including replacement latches, wood screws, and rust-inhibiting spray paint. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, this step-by-step guide will help you get your gate working like new in less than an hour. If you found this helpful, please like and follow for more DIY and contractor tips. Contractors, don\u2019t forget to check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business!",
