        'Calculate materials & costs to roof decking repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/roof-decking-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, we walk you through the complete process of roof decking repair, from site preparation to final inspection. Learn how to safely remove damaged roof decking, install new plywood panels, and restore your roof\u2019s weather protection. We cover essential materials like 5/8" CDX plywood, roofing felt, drip edge, and flashing, plus tips for proper installation and safety. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner tackling a DIY project or a contractor looking for a refresher, this guide will help you get the job done right. Have questions or want to share your experience? Drop a comment below! Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more expert construction tips.',
