      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to gas line relocation at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/gas-line-relocation/national-average\n\nIn this video, we break down the entire process of relocating a gas line, from shutting off the gas supply to final inspection and cleanup. You'll learn what materials you need\u2014like CSST gas pipe, fittings, sealant, and a pressure test gauge\u2014and how to use them safely. We cover each step in detail, including disconnecting the old line, installing and securing the new pipe, pressure testing, and restoring service. Whether you're a contractor or a handy homeowner, this guide will help you avoid common mistakes and ensure a safe, code-compliant job. Have questions or tips? Drop them in the comments, and don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more how-to videos!",
