      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to solar water heater replacement at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/solar-water-heater-replacement/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn how to replace a solar water heater from start to finish. We cover every step, from shutting down and draining the old system, to removing the old heater, installing a new 80-gallon unit, connecting all plumbing and electrical parts, and testing the system for leaks and performance. We also explain how to clean up and dispose of the old equipment safely. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, this guide will help you complete the job efficiently and safely. Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more helpful tips, and check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your contracting business!",
