      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to well cap installation at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/well-cap-installation/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn how to safely and effectively install a new sanitary, vented well cap on your water well. We\u2019ll walk you through every step\u2014from shutting off the power and removing the old cap, to inspecting the wellhead, cleaning the sealing surface, and installing the new cap with the right materials. You\u2019ll also see how to use pipe sealant, secure bolts, and disinfect your well with chlorine tablets. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, this guide will help you protect your water supply from contamination. Have questions or tips? Drop them in the comments! Don\u2019t forget to like, follow, and check out Contractor Plus for more pro resources.",
