        "Calculate materials & costs to brick patio repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/brick-patio-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, we walk you through the complete process of repairing a brick patio. Learn how to assess damage, remove and replace broken bricks, level the base, and finish with polymeric sand for a long-lasting, professional look. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner tackling a DIY project or a contractor looking for a refresher, these clear steps will help you restore your patio\u2019s beauty and safety. Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more helpful guides! Contractors\u2014discover how Contractor Plus can streamline your business and make every job easier. Leave your questions or tips in the comments below!",
