      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to tire swing installation at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/tire-swing-installation/national-average\n\nReady to add a classic tire swing to your yard? This video walks you through every step, from choosing the right tree and gathering materials, to assembling and safely installing your swing. Learn how to select a sturdy branch, drill drainage holes, use the right hardware, and protect your tree. We\u2019ll show you how to tie strong knots, adjust the swing height, and test for safety. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, you\u2019ll get clear, practical tips to make your tire swing project a success. Like and follow for more DIY guides, and contractors\u2014discover how Contractor Plus can help you run your business smarter!",
