      name: "How to Deep Clean Your Kitchen Vent Step by Step",
      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to kitchen vent cleaning at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/kitchen-vent-cleaning/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn how to deep clean your kitchen vent quickly and safely. We\u2019ll walk you through every step, from turning off the power and gathering supplies, to removing the vent cover, scrubbing away grease, and reassembling everything. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, these clear instructions will help you get the job done right and keep your kitchen air clean. Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more helpful tips! Contractors, check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business. Have questions or want to share your own cleaning tips? Drop a comment below!",
