      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to wallpaper removal and painting at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/wallpaper-removal-and-painting/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn how to remove wallpaper and paint your walls step by step. We cover everything: prepping your room, removing old wallpaper, cleaning and repairing the surface, priming, and painting for a flawless finish. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner tackling a DIY project or a contractor looking for a refresher, these tips will help you get professional results. Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more home improvement guides! Contractors\u2014discover how Contractor Plus can streamline your business and make every job easier. Drop your questions or share your own tips in the comments below!",
