      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to base cabinet installation at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/base-cabinet-installation/national-average\n\nIn this video, you\u2019ll learn how to install three base cabinets in your kitchen or workspace, even if you\u2019re new to the process. We cover everything from site preparation and marking your layout, to leveling, shimming, and securing each cabinet for a professional finish. You\u2019ll also see how to install toe kicks and make final adjustments so your cabinets are ready for countertops. Whether you\u2019re a DIY homeowner or a contractor looking for a refresher, this guide will help you get the job done right. If you found this helpful, please like and follow for more tips, and check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your contracting business!",
