        "Calculate materials & costs to garage door hinge replacement at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/garage-door-hinge-replacement/national-average\n\nIn this video, we show you exactly how to replace garage door hinges safely and efficiently. Learn what tools and materials you need, how to remove old hinges without damaging your door, and the right way to install new hinges for smooth operation. We cover every step, from unplugging the opener to testing your door after the job is done. Whether you're a homeowner tackling a DIY project or a contractor looking for a quick refresher, this guide will help you get the job done right. If you found this helpful, please like and follow for more tips. Contractors, check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business!",
