      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to sod prep and installation at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/sod-prep-and-installation/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn how to prep your yard and install sod for a beautiful, healthy lawn. We cover every step: clearing and grading the site, preparing the soil, laying sod rolls, and giving your new grass the right care. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, you\u2019ll get clear, practical tips to ensure your sod takes root and thrives. Find out what materials you\u2019ll need, how much time to budget, and the best practices for a smooth, professional result. Like and follow for more how-to guides, and if you\u2019re a contractor, discover how Contractor Plus can help you run your business better!",
