      transcript:
        "Want a lush green lawn fast? Laying sod is the quickest way to transform your yard. In this video, I\u2019ll show you step-by-step how to prep and install sod like a pro.\n\nFirst, clear your site. Remove old grass, weeds, rocks, and debris. Grade the soil so water drains away from your house and the surface is smooth.\n\nNext, prep the soil. Loosen it to about 3-4 inches deep. Mix in compost or topsoil to improve growth. Level the area and water it lightly to settle the soil.\n\nNow, it\u2019s time to lay the sod. Start along a straight edge. Place sod pieces tightly together in a staggered pattern, like bricks. Press the seams down and trim the edges to fit. Use a roller to press the sod into the soil for good contact.\n\nFinally, water the new sod thoroughly. Keep it moist all day for the first day. Avoid walking on it and check moisture often to help roots grow strong.\n\nIf you liked this video, I appreciate the like and follow. If you're a contractor, come check out Contractor Plus. We've built the ultimate operating system for build and service contractors. Thanks for watching!",
