      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to build partition wall at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/build-partition-wall/national-average\n\nIn this video, we show you exactly how to build a partition wall from start to finish. Learn how to measure and mark your layout, frame the wall with 2x4 studs, add electrical and insulation, hang drywall, and finish with paint. Whether you\u2019re a DIY homeowner or a contractor, these clear steps will help you create a sturdy, professional-looking wall. Have questions or want more tips? Drop a comment below! Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more construction how-tos. Contractors\u2014discover how Contractor Plus can streamline your business today!",
