        "Calculate materials & costs to window sensor installation at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/window-sensor-installation/national-average\n\nIn this video, you\u2019ll learn how to install window sensors to boost your home\u2019s security. We\u2019ll walk you through gathering the right materials, planning sensor placement, mounting the sensors and magnets, and connecting everything to your security system. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner looking to DIY or a contractor wanting a quick refresher, this guide covers all the key steps for a smooth installation. Don\u2019t forget to test each sensor to make sure your system is working perfectly. If you found this helpful, hit like and follow for more tips. Contractors, check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business!",
