      name: "How to Adjust a Door for a Perfect Fit (DIY Guide)",
      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to door adjustment at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/door-adjustment/national-average\n\nIn this video, we show you step-by-step how to adjust a door that sticks, sags, or won't close properly. You'll learn how to inspect your door and frame, tighten and adjust hardware, use wood shims for alignment, and lubricate hinges for smooth operation. Whether you're a homeowner or a contractor, these simple tips will help you fix most door problems in under an hour. Got questions or want more DIY tips? Drop a comment below, like, and follow for more home improvement guides. Contractors\u2014discover how Contractor Plus can streamline your business today!",
