      name: "Subdivision Survey: Step-by-Step Guide for Contractors",
      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to subdivision survey at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/subdivision-survey/national-average\n\nThinking about dividing land into separate lots? This video breaks down the entire subdivision survey process, from initial research to final approval. Learn what materials you need\u2014like surveyor stakes, flagging tape, rebar pins, marking paint, and boundary monuments\u2014and how to use them on site. We\u2019ll walk you through planning, fieldwork, drafting plats, and submitting your survey to local authorities. Whether you\u2019re a contractor or a homeowner, you\u2019ll get clear steps to make your project a success. Like and follow for more construction tips, and check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your contracting business!",
