      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to garage door weather seal installation at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/garage-door-weather-seal-installation/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn how to install a new weather seal on your garage door to keep out drafts, water, and pests. We\u2019ll walk you through removing the old seal, measuring and cutting the new one, and securing it for a tight fit. This simple DIY project can help lower your energy bills and protect your garage from the elements. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, these clear steps will help you get the job done right. Have questions or tips? Drop them in the comments! Don\u2019t forget to like, follow, and check out Contractor Plus for more pro tips and tools.",
