      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to window balance repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/window-balance-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn how to repair a window balance and restore smooth operation to your windows. We\u2019ll walk you through removing the window sash, replacing old or broken balances, and reinstalling the sash for a perfect fit. Whether you have spiral or block and tackle balances, you\u2019ll see exactly what tools and materials you need, plus tips for a safe and easy repair. This guide is perfect for homeowners and contractors looking to save time and money on window repairs. If you found this helpful, don\u2019t forget to like, follow, and share your questions or experiences in the comments!",
