      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to deck flashing repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/deck-flashing-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, we show you exactly how to repair deck flashing and stop leaks where your deck meets your house. You'll learn how to inspect for damage, remove old flashing, install new aluminum or galvanized steel flashing, and seal everything for a watertight finish. We cover the tools and materials you need, plus tips for working safely and efficiently. Whether you're a homeowner or a contractor, this guide will help you protect your deck and home from costly water damage. If you found this helpful, please like and follow for more DIY and pro construction tips. Contractors\u2014discover how Contractor Plus can streamline your business today!",
