      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to pipe replacement at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/pipe-replacement/national-average\n\nIn this video, we break down the entire pipe replacement process, from shutting off your water supply to installing new PEX pipes and fittings. Learn how to safely remove old pipes, measure and cut new ones, and ensure every connection is leak-free. We cover the essential materials you\u2019ll need\u2014like pipe insulation, hangers, and joint compound\u2014and give you a realistic timeline for each step. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner tackling a DIY project or a contractor looking for a refresher, this guide will help you get the job done right. Have questions or tips? Drop them in the comments, and don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more practical construction advice!",
