      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to sprinkler leak detection at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/sprinkler-leak-detection/national-average\n\nIn this video, you\u2019ll learn how to detect and repair leaks in your sprinkler system like a pro. We\u2019ll walk you through a simple, step-by-step process: from inspecting your system and pressure testing, to using leak detection dye and acoustic tools to find hidden leaks. You\u2019ll also see how to mark leak locations and make quick repairs to pipes, fittings, or sprinkler heads. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, these tips will help you save water, prevent damage, and keep your landscape healthy. Got questions or tips of your own? Drop them in the comments! Don\u2019t forget to like, follow, and check out Contractor Plus for more contractor resources.",
