      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to front porch addition at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/front-porch-addition/national-average\n\nThinking about adding a front porch to your home? This video walks you through every step, from planning and permits to framing, decking, and finishing touches. Learn what materials you'll need, how long each phase takes, and key tips for a safe, sturdy build. Whether you're a homeowner or a contractor, you'll get clear, practical advice to make your porch project a success. Have questions or want to share your own porch-building experience? Drop a comment below! And don't forget to like and follow for more expert construction tips.",
