      transcript:
        "Want to light up your space with a stylish wall sconce? Let\u2019s walk through how to install one safely and easily.\n\nIn this video, you\u2019ll learn how to install a wall sconce from start to finish, including wiring and mounting.\n\nFirst, turn off the power at your breaker box. Double-check with a voltage tester to make sure the power is off. Clear the area where you\u2019ll be working.\n\nNext, install or inspect the electrical box where your sconce will go. Attach the mounting bracket to the box, making sure it\u2019s secure and level. Follow your local electrical codes.\n\nNow, connect the wires. Match the black wires together, then the white wires, and finally the ground wires. Use wire connectors for each. Tuck the wires into the box, then attach the sconce to the bracket. Install the bulb and the wall plate or cover.\n\nTurn the power back on and test your new wall sconce. Enjoy your upgraded lighting!\n\nIf you liked this video, I appreciate the like and follow. If you're a contractor, come check out Contractor Plus. We've built the ultimate operating system for build and service contractors. Thanks for watching!",
