      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to brick foundation repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/brick-foundation-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, we walk you through the complete process of repairing a brick foundation. You\u2019ll learn how to inspect for damage, remove old bricks and mortar, install new bricks, and apply fresh mortar for a strong, lasting repair. We cover the essential materials you\u2019ll need\u2014like replacement bricks, Type N mortar, bonding agent, and waterproofing sealant\u2014and break down each step so you can tackle the job with confidence. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, these tips will help you restore your foundation safely and efficiently. If you found this guide helpful, please like and follow for more construction tips. Contractors, don\u2019t forget to check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business!",
