      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to deck rebuilding at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/deck-rebuilding/national-average\n\nIn this video, we break down the complete process of rebuilding a 200 sq ft deck, from demolition to finishing touches. Learn which materials you\u2019ll need, how much time each step takes, and the best practices for framing, decking, and installing railings. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner tackling a DIY project or a contractor looking for a quick refresher, this guide covers everything you need for a safe, sturdy, and great-looking deck. Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more practical construction tips, and let us know your deck questions in the comments!",
