      "@type": "VideoObject",
      name: "How to Detect & Stop Emergency Water Leaks Fast",
      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to emergency leak detection at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/emergency-leak-detection/national-average\n\nIn this video, we show you exactly how to handle an emergency water leak in your home or building. Learn how to quickly assess the situation, use tools like moisture meters and leak detectors, and apply temporary repairs with clamps, epoxy, or Teflon tape. We\u2019ll also cover how to document the damage and what to do next for a permanent fix. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, these steps will help you minimize water damage and get control of the situation fast. Like and follow for more practical tips, and check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your contracting business.",
      thumbnailUrl:
        "https://contractor-plus-website.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/og-images/8be5a508-66e1-4e84-aef6-389dfe66b620.jpg",
