      name: "How to Caulk Tile Joints Like a Pro: Step-by-Step Guide",
      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to tile caulking at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/tile-caulking/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn how to caulk tile joints for a clean, water-resistant finish that lasts. We\u2019ll walk you through every step\u2014from prepping the surface and choosing the right materials, to applying and smoothing the caulk for a professional look. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner tackling a bathroom or kitchen project, or a contractor looking to refresh your skills, this guide covers everything you need to know. Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more practical tips, and if you\u2019re a contractor, check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business. Drop your questions or experiences in the comments below!",
      thumbnailUrl:
        "https://contractor-plus-website.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/og-images/329ab0b5-2373-4f1b-aaa3-33ff8ec711f3.jpg",
      uploadDate: "2025-08-04",
