      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to replace polybutylene pipes at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/replace-polybutylene-pipes/national-average\n\nIn this video, we walk you through the full process of replacing old polybutylene pipes with reliable PEX piping. Learn how to assess your plumbing, plan the job, gather the right materials, and safely remove and replace your pipes. We cover every step, from shutting off the water and removing old lines, to installing new PEX, testing for leaks, and restoring your walls. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, you\u2019ll get practical tips to make the job smooth and code-compliant. Have questions or tips of your own? Drop them in the comments! Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more expert construction guides.",
