      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to fence maintenance at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/fence-maintenance/national-average\n\nIn this video, we walk you through the complete process of wood fence maintenance\u2014from inspection and cleaning, to repairs, surface prep, and applying a fresh coat of stain or paint. Learn what tools and materials you\u2019ll need, how to spot and fix common problems, and the best way to protect your fence for years to come. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, these clear steps will help you keep your fence looking great and lasting longer. If you found this guide helpful, please like and follow for more tips. Contractors, don\u2019t forget to check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business!",
