      transcript:
        "Want to give your kitchen a fresh look in just a few hours? Today, I\u2019ll show you how to install new cabinet doors step by step, so you get a pro finish every time.\n\nFirst, remove the old doors and hardware. Use a screwdriver or drill to unscrew the hinges and handles. Clean the cabinet frames to get rid of dust and grease.\n\nNext, measure your cabinet openings. Mark where the new hinges will go on both the cabinet frame and the new doors. Double-check your marks for perfect alignment.\n\nNow, attach the hinges to your new doors. Use the right screws and make sure each hinge sits flush. A drill makes this quick and easy.\n\nMount the doors onto the cabinet frames. Line up the hinges with your marks, then screw them in. Adjust the hinges so the doors hang straight and open smoothly.\n\nFinally, install your handles or knobs. Tighten all hardware and make any last adjustments so the doors are level and secure. Clean up your workspace, and you\u2019re done!\n\nIf you liked this video, I appreciate the like and follow. If you're a contractor, come check out Contractor Plus. We've built the ultimate operating system for build and service contractors. Thanks for watching!",
