      name: "How to Install Quarter Round Molding Like a Pro",
      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to quarter round installation at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/quarter-round-installation/national-average\n\nIn this video, you\u2019ll learn how to install quarter round molding for a clean, professional finish on your floors. We cover every step: measuring and cutting the molding, prepping your surfaces, nailing the quarter round in place, and finishing with wood filler, caulk, and paint. Whether you\u2019re a DIY homeowner or a contractor, these tips will help you get tight corners and seamless edges every time. Have questions or want to share your own tips? Drop a comment below! Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more practical construction guides. Contractors\u2014discover how Contractor Plus can streamline your business today!",
