        "Calculate materials & costs to gutter realignment at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/gutter-realignment/national-average\n\nIn this video, we walk you through the step-by-step process of gutter realignment. Learn how to inspect your gutters for sagging or poor slope, safely remove and clean them, and reinstall with the correct angle for optimal water flow. We cover the essential materials\u2014like hangers, screws, sealant, and straps\u2014and show you how to seal and test your system for leaks. Whether you're a homeowner tackling a DIY project or a contractor looking for best practices, this guide will help you get the job done right. Like, follow, and let us know your gutter questions in the comments!",
