      name: "How to Install Window Glass: Step-by-Step Guide",
      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to window glass installation at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/window-glass-installation/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn how to replace and install window glass safely and efficiently. We cover every step, from removing old glass and prepping the frame, to measuring, fitting, and sealing your new glass pane for a weather-tight finish. Whether you\u2019re a DIY homeowner or a professional contractor, these clear instructions will help you get the job done right the first time. Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more helpful construction tips! Contractors, discover how Contractor Plus can streamline your business with our all-in-one operating system. Leave your questions or experiences in the comments below!",
