      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to porch demolition at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/porch-demolition/national-average\n\nReady to remove your old porch? This video walks you through every step of the porch demolition process, from site prep and safety to debris removal and cleanup. Learn what tools and materials you\u2019ll need, how to disconnect utilities, and the safest way to dismantle your porch. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner tackling a DIY project or a contractor looking for a quick refresher, this guide will help you plan and execute a smooth demolition. Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more helpful construction tips! Contractors\u2014discover how Contractor Plus can streamline your business operations today.",
