      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to corroded pipe repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/corroded-pipe-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, we show you exactly how to repair a corroded copper pipe in your home or project. Learn how to safely shut off your water, remove the damaged section, and install a new pipe with the right materials and tools. We cover everything from cutting and cleaning the pipe to soldering joints and testing for leaks. Whether you\u2019re a DIY homeowner or a professional contractor, these clear steps will help you get the job done right. Have questions or tips? Drop them in the comments! Don\u2019t forget to like, follow, and check out Contractor Plus for more contractor resources and tools.",
