      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to window screen installation at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/window-screen-installation/national-average\n\nIn this video, you\u2019ll learn how to install a window screen from start to finish. We\u2019ll cover how to measure your window, cut and assemble the frame, secure the mesh with spline, and install the finished screen. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner looking to save money or a contractor wanting a quick refresher, this guide breaks down each step with clear instructions and helpful tips. Don\u2019t let bugs or debris sneak in\u2014get your window screens installed right the first time! If you found this video helpful, please like and follow for more DIY and contractor tips. Contractors, check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business. Let us know your questions or share your own tips in the comments!",
