      name: "Hot Tub Maintenance: Step-by-Step Guide for Clean Water",
      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to hot tub maintenance service at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/hot-tub-maintenance-service/national-average\n\nIn this video, we break down the essential steps for effective hot tub maintenance. Learn how to safely drain and clean your hot tub, inspect all components for wear or damage, and properly balance your water chemistry using the right materials. We cover everything from using filter cleaners and test strips to adding sanitizers and shock treatments. Whether you're a homeowner or a contractor, these tips will help you keep your hot tub running smoothly and safely. Have questions or tips of your own? Drop them in the comments, and don't forget to like and follow for more helpful guides!",
