      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to property boundary survey at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/property-boundary-survey/national-average\n\nIn this video, you\u2019ll learn how to perform a property boundary survey from start to finish. We\u2019ll cover everything from gathering the right documents and materials, to marking property corners and creating an accurate boundary map. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner wanting to know your exact property lines, or a contractor looking to deliver professional results, this guide breaks down each step in simple terms. Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more helpful construction tips! If you\u2019re a contractor, check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to manage your business. Drop your questions or experiences in the comments below\u2014we\u2019d love to hear from you!",
