      name: "How to Install a Whole House Iron Filter System",
      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to iron filter installation at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/iron-filter-installation/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn how to install a whole-house iron filter system to get rid of rusty water and improve your home's water quality. We cover every step, from shutting off the main water supply and choosing the right location, to connecting pipes, installing the bypass valve, adding filter media, and testing the system. Whether you're a homeowner or a contractor, you'll get clear, easy-to-follow instructions and tips to ensure a leak-free, effective installation. Have questions or want to share your experience? Drop a comment below! Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more helpful guides. Contractors\u2014discover how Contractor Plus can streamline your business today!",
      thumbnailUrl:
        "https://contractor-plus-website.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/og-images/311f7fcd-32a6-44f3-be43-ab1993eae93a.jpg",
