      name: "How to Replace a Carbon Filter: Step-by-Step Guide",
      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to carbon filter replacement at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/carbon-filter-replacement/national-average\n\nIn this video, we show you exactly how to replace a carbon filter in your water filtration system. You'll learn how to safely turn off the water, remove the old filter, clean the housing, and install a new carbon filter cartridge. We also cover replacing the O-ring or gasket and using Teflon plumber\u2019s tape for a leak-free seal. Whether you're a homeowner or a contractor, these clear steps will help you keep your water clean and your system running smoothly. Got questions or tips? Drop them in the comments! Don\u2019t forget to like, follow, and check out Contractor Plus for more pro tips and tools.",
