        "Calculate materials & costs to boundary marking at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/boundary-marking/national-average\n\nIn this video, we break down the complete process for marking property boundaries, whether you're a homeowner or a contractor. Learn how to assess your site, clear and measure the boundary line, install visible markers, and document your work for legal and neighborly peace of mind. We cover the essential tools and materials you'll need, including stakes, flagging tape, and marking paint, plus tips for staying compliant with local regulations. If you want to avoid disputes and ensure your property lines are clear, this guide is for you. Like, follow, and let us know your questions in the comments!",
