      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to add light switch at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/add-light-switch/national-average\n\nIn this video, you\u2019ll learn how to add a new light switch to any room, step by step. We cover everything from turning off the power and planning your switch location, to cutting the wall, running new wiring, and installing the switch safely. You\u2019ll see which materials you need\u2014like a single pole switch, electrical box, Romex wire, and connectors\u2014and get clear instructions for wiring and testing. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, this guide will help you complete the job with confidence. Have questions or tips? Drop them in the comments! Don\u2019t forget to like, follow, and check out Contractor Plus for more pro resources.",
