      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to drain leak repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/drain-leak-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, you'll learn how to repair a leaking drain pipe quickly and safely, whether you're a homeowner or a contractor. We cover every step: finding the leak, shutting off the water, removing and replacing damaged pipes, and testing your repair. You'll see which materials you need\u2014like PVC pipe, couplings, plumber\u2019s putty, and Teflon tape\u2014and get clear instructions for a leak-free finish. This guide is perfect for anyone wanting to save money and prevent water damage. If you found this helpful, please like and follow for more DIY and contractor tips. Contractors, check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business!",
