      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to radiant floor heating repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/radiant-floor-heating-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, we walk you through the complete process of repairing a radiant floor heating system. Learn how to inspect for leaks, fix damaged PEX tubing, replace faulty components, and ensure your system is running smoothly. We cover essential materials like repair kits, manifold fittings, and leak detection dye, plus tips for bleeding and pressure testing your system. Whether you're a homeowner tackling a cold spot or a contractor looking for a refresher, this guide will help you restore even, comfortable heat to your floors. Have questions or tips? Drop them in the comments, and don't forget to like and follow for more expert repair guides!",
