      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to corner bead repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/corner-bead-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, you\u2019ll learn how to repair a damaged drywall corner bead from start to finish. We\u2019ll cover everything: removing old materials, installing a new metal corner bead, applying joint compound, sanding, and painting for a flawless finish. Whether you\u2019re a DIY homeowner or a contractor, these clear steps will help you get professional results. Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more tips! Contractors, check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business. Drop your questions or share your own tips in the comments below!",
