      transcript:
        "Want to make your room look finished and high-end? Let\u2019s walk through how to install interior trim like a pro. In this video, you\u2019ll learn every step, from measuring to painting, so you can get perfect results. \n\nFirst, measure all your walls, doors, and windows. Mark and cut your trim pieces with a miter saw\u2014double-check every measurement before you cut. Next, dry fit each piece in place. This helps you spot any gaps or tight spots. Adjust as needed for smooth corners and tight joints.\n\nNow, install the trim. Start with the longest runs. Use finish nails or adhesive to secure each piece. Make sure everything is level and lines up as you go. Once it\u2019s up, fill nail holes and seams with wood filler. Caulk any gaps, then sand everything smooth when dry.\n\nFinally, paint or stain your trim. Let it dry, touch up any spots, and clean up your workspace. That\u2019s it\u2014your room looks amazing!\n\nIf you liked this video, I appreciate the like and follow. If you're a contractor, come check out Contractor Plus. We've built the ultimate operating system for build and service contractors. Thanks for watching!",
