        "Calculate materials & costs to retaining wall demolition at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/retaining-wall-demolition/national-average\n\nThinking about removing a concrete or masonry retaining wall? This video breaks down the entire demolition process, from site prep and safety to debris removal and cleanup. Learn what equipment and materials you\u2019ll need, how to protect your crew and property, and the best way to keep your project on schedule. We cover key steps like utility marking, using a mini excavator with a breaker, dust control, and proper disposal. Whether you\u2019re a contractor or a DIY homeowner, you\u2019ll get clear, practical tips to make your retaining wall demolition safe and efficient. Like, follow, and let us know your questions in the comments!",
