        "Calculate materials & costs to gutter fascia repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/gutter-fascia-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, we walk you through the complete process of gutter and fascia repair, from inspection to final cleanup. Learn how to spot damage, safely remove old materials, install new fascia boards and gutters, and seal everything for a leak-free finish. We cover the essential tools, materials, and safety tips you need to get the job done right. Whether you're a homeowner tackling repairs or a contractor looking for a refresher, this guide will help you protect your home from water damage and keep your roof in top shape. Like, follow, and share your questions or tips in the comments below!",
