        "Calculate materials & costs to security system testing at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/security-system-testing/national-average\n\nIn this video, you\u2019ll learn how to properly test your security system to make sure it\u2019s protecting your property. We\u2019ll walk you through inspecting all components, running functional tests on sensors, alarms, and cameras, and documenting your results. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, these steps will help you spot issues before they become problems. We\u2019ll also cover what materials you might need, like test equipment, replacement batteries, and wiring connectors. If you want your security system to work when it matters most, don\u2019t skip these steps! Like and follow for more tips, and contractors\u2014discover how Contractor Plus can help you run your business smarter.",
