      transcript:
        "Did you know a simple test could reveal hidden flaws in your security system? Today, I\u2019ll show you how to test your security system step by step, so you know it\u2019s working when you need it most. \n\nFirst, start with a full inspection. Check every sensor, camera, and alarm in your home or building. Make sure all devices are installed right and have power. Replace any weak batteries and look for loose wiring connectors.\n\nNext, it\u2019s time for functional testing. Use test equipment to trigger each sensor\u2014like opening doors or windows\u2014and watch how the system responds. Test every alarm and camera, making sure they send alerts and record footage as they should. Move through each area to cover all entry points.\n\nFinally, review your results. Write down what worked and what didn\u2019t. Fix any issues you found, update your system logs, and note any upgrades you recommend.\n\nIf you liked this video, I appreciate the like and follow. If you're a contractor, come check out Contractor Plus. We've built the ultimate operating system for build and service contractors. Thanks for watching!",
