      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to garage floor installation at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/garage-floor-installation/national-average\n\nReady to upgrade your garage? This video walks you through every step of installing a new garage floor, from surface prep to the final sealer. Learn how to clear and clean your space, lay a moisture barrier, pour and reinforce concrete, and finish with a durable sealer. We cover the essential materials, tools, and time needed for a standard 400 sq ft garage. Whether you\u2019re a DIY homeowner or a contractor, you\u2019ll get clear, practical tips to ensure a smooth, long-lasting result. Have questions or want more pro tips? Drop a comment below, like, and follow for more how-to videos. Contractors\u2014discover how Contractor Plus can streamline your business today!",
