      name: "How to Adjust Gutter Slope for Perfect Drainage",
      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to gutter slope adjustment at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/gutter-slope-adjustment/national-average\n\nIn this video, you'll learn step-by-step how to adjust your gutter slope to stop overflow and ensure proper drainage. We'll cover everything from inspecting your gutters and measuring the correct slope, to safely detaching and repositioning the gutters, reattaching with hangers, sealing joints, and testing for leaks. Whether you're a homeowner tackling a DIY project or a contractor looking for a quick refresher, this guide will help you get the job done right. Have questions or tips? Drop them in the comments! Like and follow for more practical home improvement guides, and check out Contractor Plus for the best contractor tools and resources.",
