      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to porch resurfacing at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/porch-resurfacing/national-average\n\nReady to upgrade your porch? This video walks you through the entire porch resurfacing process, from surface prep to the final finish. Learn how to clean, repair, and resurface your porch using concrete resurfacer, bonding agent, and the right tools. We cover how to patch cracks, apply primer, and get a smooth, durable finish that lasts. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, these clear steps will help you achieve professional results. Have questions or tips? Drop them in the comments! Don\u2019t forget to like, follow, and check out Contractor Plus for more resources and tools for contractors.",
