      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to main water line replacement at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/main-water-line-replacement/national-average\n\nIn this video, we break down the entire process of replacing a main water line, from shutting off your water supply to restoring your yard. You'll learn how to safely excavate, remove the old pipe, install new PEX piping with brass fittings, and ensure everything is up to code. We also cover pressure testing, inspection, and the best way to backfill and clean up the site. Whether you're a homeowner planning a DIY project or a contractor looking for a refresher, this guide will help you avoid common mistakes and get the job done right. If you found this helpful, please like and follow for more tips. Contractors, check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business!",
