      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to masonry repointing at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/masonry-repointing/national-average\n\nIn this video, we break down the complete process of masonry repointing, perfect for homeowners and contractors alike. Learn how to remove old mortar, mix the right materials, and apply new mortar for a durable, professional finish. We cover essential tools, material tips, and curing techniques to ensure your brickwork stands the test of time. Whether you\u2019re restoring a historic wall or fixing up your home, these clear steps will help you get the job done right. Have questions or want to share your own tips? Drop a comment below! Don\u2019t forget to like, follow, and check out Contractor Plus for more pro construction resources.",
