      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to radon mitigation system inspection at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/radon-mitigation-system-inspection/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn how to inspect a radon mitigation system in your home or job site. We\u2019ll walk you through each step: from checking the fan and pipes for damage, to testing airflow, inspecting seals, and verifying system labels. You\u2019ll also see how to use a manometer and a radon test kit to make sure your system is working and your air is safe. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, these tips will help you spot problems early and keep your property protected. Drop your questions in the comments, and don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more contractor tips!",
