      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to air duct inspection at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/air-duct-inspection/national-average\n\nIn this video, you'll learn how to perform a thorough air duct inspection in your home or commercial property. We break down each step, from the initial visual assessment to system testing and a detailed internal check using basic tools and an inspection camera. You'll discover what signs to look for, how to measure airflow, and how to document your findings for future cleaning or repairs. Whether you're a homeowner wanting cleaner air or a contractor looking to offer this service, this guide will help you do the job right. Have questions or tips? Drop them in the comments and join the conversation!",
