      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to pipe rerouting at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/pipe-rerouting/national-average\n\nIn this video, we break down the entire process of rerouting plumbing pipes, from planning and removal to installation and testing. You'll learn how to safely shut off your water, access and remove old pipes, install new PEX pipes and fittings, and restore your walls or floors. We cover essential materials like PEX pipe, elbow fittings, couplings, insulation, and shutoff valves, plus tips for leak testing and code compliance. Whether you're a homeowner tackling a DIY project or a contractor looking for a refresher, this guide will help you get the job done right. Like and follow for more practical construction tips, and let us know your questions or experiences in the comments!",
