      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to gutter fascia installation at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/gutter-fascia-installation/national-average\n\nIn this video, you\u2019ll learn how to remove old gutters and fascia, inspect and repair the substructure, install new fascia boards, and mount and seal new gutters for a leak-free finish. We break down each step, from prepping your roofline to final inspection and cleanup, so you can tackle this project with confidence. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, these tips will help you get professional results and protect your home from water damage. Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more how-to guides, and let us know in the comments if you have any questions or want to share your own gutter installation tips!",
