      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to brick fireplace repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/brick-fireplace-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, we show you exactly how to repair a brick fireplace, from start to finish. Learn how to inspect for damage, remove old bricks and mortar, set new bricks, and finish the job with a clean, professional look. We cover the tools and materials you\u2019ll need, including replacement bricks, mortar mix, firebricks, and more. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner tackling a DIY project or a contractor looking for a refresher, this guide will help you get the job done right. Have questions or want more tips? Drop a comment below, like, and follow for more home repair tutorials!",
