      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to kitchen electrical installation at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/kitchen-electrical-installation/national-average\n\nIn this video, you\u2019ll learn how to install electrical wiring in a kitchen, from planning and safety to wiring, device installation, and final testing. We\u2019ll cover the essential materials you need\u2014like 12/2 NM-B wire, electrical boxes, GFCI outlets, switches, and more\u2014plus tips for following code and ensuring a safe, reliable setup. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner tackling a remodel or a contractor looking for a refresher, this guide walks you through each step so you can wire a kitchen confidently. Have questions or want to share your own tips? Drop a comment below! Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more pro construction guides.",
