      name: "How to Install a Vanity Light: Step-by-Step Guide",
      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to vanity light installation at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/vanity-light-installation/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn how to install a new vanity light fixture in your bathroom or any space, safely and efficiently. We\u2019ll walk you through turning off the power, removing the old fixture, installing the new mounting bracket, wiring the new light, and testing your work. Whether you\u2019re a DIY homeowner or a contractor, these clear steps will help you get the job done right the first time. Don\u2019t forget to use the right materials and double-check your wiring for safety. If you found this guide helpful, please like and follow for more tips. Contractors, discover how Contractor Plus can streamline your business operations. Leave your questions or experiences in the comments below!",
