      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to install ceiling fan wiring at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/install-ceiling-fan-wiring/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn how to safely and efficiently install ceiling fan wiring in your home. We cover everything from turning off the power and prepping your workspace, to installing a fan-rated electrical box, running new wiring, and making all the right connections. Whether you\u2019re a DIY homeowner or a contractor, you\u2019ll get clear, practical steps to ensure your ceiling fan is wired correctly and safely. Don\u2019t forget to test your work and patch up any drywall for a clean finish. If you found this guide helpful, please like and follow for more tips. Contractors, check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business!",
