      transcript:
        "Want a lush green lawn fast? Here\u2019s how to get perfect sod delivered and installed, step by step. \n\nIn this video, you\u2019ll learn exactly how to prep your yard, lay sod, and care for it so it thrives. \n\nFirst, clear your yard. Remove old grass, rocks, and debris. Level the soil and make sure water will drain away from your house. This takes about two hours.\n\nNext, add topsoil or compost and starter fertilizer. Till the soil about 2 to 3 inches deep. Water the area well\u2014this helps new roots grow strong.\n\nWhen your sod arrives, start laying it right away. Place each piece tightly together in a staggered pattern, like bricks. Trim the edges for a perfect fit. Don\u2019t leave any gaps.\n\nAfter all the sod is down, use a lawn roller to press it into the soil. This helps the roots connect. Water the whole area right away.\n\nFinally, clean up and give your new lawn its first care. Water daily for the first week, and wait a couple of weeks before mowing.\n\nIf you liked this video, I appreciate the like and follow. If you're a contractor, come check out Contractor Plus. We've built the ultimate operating system for build and service contractors. Thanks for watching!",
