      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to masonry veneer installation at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/masonry-veneer-installation/national-average\n\nIn this video, we walk you through the complete process of installing masonry veneer, from prepping your wall to the final inspection. Learn how to choose and use the right materials, mix mortar, lay out your veneer pattern, and install each stone or brick for a professional finish. We also cover grouting, detailing, and curing tips to ensure your project lasts. Whether you\u2019re a DIY homeowner or a contractor looking to brush up on best practices, this guide will help you achieve great results. Have questions or want to share your own tips? Drop a comment below, like, and follow for more construction how-tos!",
