      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to vinyl window installation at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/vinyl-window-installation/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn how to install a vinyl window from start to finish. We cover removing the old window, prepping the opening, installing the new vinyl unit, and sealing everything for a weatherproof fit. You\u2019ll get clear, simple instructions on using shims, spray foam, caulk, and trim for a professional result. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, this guide will help you avoid common mistakes and get the job done right. Have questions or tips? Drop them in the comments! Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more how-to videos, and check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your contracting business.",
