      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to sprinkler backflow preventer installation at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/sprinkler-backflow-preventer-installation/national-average\n\nIn this video, you\u2019ll learn how to install a sprinkler backflow preventer to keep your water supply safe. We\u2019ll walk you through shutting off the water, prepping the site, cutting and connecting pipes, and testing for leaks. You\u2019ll see which materials you need, how to use PVC primer and cement, and how to make sure your installation meets local codes. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, this guide will help you do the job right and avoid costly mistakes. Got questions or tips? Drop them in the comments! Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more how-to videos, and check out Contractor Plus for the best contractor tools and resources.",
