      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to sod laying service at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/sod-laying-service/national-average\n\nIn this video, you\u2019ll learn exactly how to lay sod for a beautiful, healthy lawn. We cover every step\u2014from site prep and soil conditioning to laying sod rolls, watering, and aftercare. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, you\u2019ll get clear, practical tips to ensure your sod takes root and thrives. We also share how to estimate materials like sod rolls, fertilizer, and topsoil, so you can plan your project and budget with confidence. If you found this guide helpful, please like and follow for more how-to videos. Contractors, don\u2019t forget to check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business!",
