        "Calculate materials & costs to garage door strut installation at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/garage-door-strut-installation/national-average\n\nIn this step-by-step video, we show you how to install struts on your garage door to prevent sagging and improve durability. You\u2019ll learn what tools and materials you need, how to safely prepare your garage door, and the best way to position and secure each strut. We\u2019ll also cover how to test your door for smooth operation after installation. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner looking to DIY or a contractor wanting a quick refresher, this guide will help you get the job done right. Have questions or tips? Drop them in the comments! Don\u2019t forget to like, follow, and check out Contractor Plus for more pro resources.",
