      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to nail pop repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/nail-pop-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, we show you exactly how to repair nail pops in your drywall or ceiling. You\u2019ll learn how to spot nail pops, secure loose drywall, patch the area with joint compound, and finish with sanding, priming, and painting. We break down each step so you can get professional-looking results, whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor. No special skills needed\u2014just a few basic tools and materials. If you found this guide helpful, please like and follow for more home repair tips. Contractors, don\u2019t forget to check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business. Drop your questions or share your own tips in the comments below!",
