      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to toilet upgrade at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/toilet-upgrade/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn how to upgrade your toilet quickly and efficiently. We walk you through every step, from shutting off the water and removing the old toilet, to preparing the area, installing a new wax ring, and setting your new toilet in place. You\u2019ll also see how to reconnect the water supply, check for leaks, and finish with a clean caulk seal. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, these clear instructions will help you get the job done right. Like and follow for more DIY and contractor tips, and visit Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your contracting business!",
