      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to garbage disposal flange installation at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/garbage-disposal-flange-installation/national-average\n\nIn this video, you\u2019ll learn how to remove an old garbage disposal flange and install a new one with simple tools and materials. We\u2019ll cover disconnecting the disposal, cleaning the sink opening, applying plumber\u2019s putty, securing the new flange, and testing for leaks. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner tackling your first sink project or a contractor looking for a quick refresher, this guide will help you get the job done right. Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more helpful how-to videos. Contractors, check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business. Drop your questions or tips in the comments below!",
