      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to porch waterproofing at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/porch-waterproofing/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn how to waterproof your porch from start to finish. We cover everything: cleaning and prepping the surface, repairing cracks, applying a liquid waterproofing membrane, and sealing all the edges and joints. You\u2019ll also find out which materials you need\u2014like primer, reinforcing fabric, sealant, and non-slip additives\u2014and how to use them for the best results. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, these clear steps will help you protect your porch from water damage and extend its life. Got questions or tips? Drop them in the comments! Don\u2019t forget to like, follow, and check out Contractor Plus for more pro resources.",
