      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to ceiling texture repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/ceiling-texture-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, we show you exactly how to repair damaged ceiling texture and get a seamless finish. You'll learn how to prep your space, patch and prime damaged areas, apply new texture to match your existing ceiling, and finish with a perfect paint job. We break down each step so you know what tools and materials you need, how long each stage takes, and the best techniques for a professional result. Whether you're a homeowner tackling a DIY project or a contractor looking for a refresher, this guide will help you get the job done right. If you found this helpful, please like and follow for more tips. Contractors, check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business!",
