      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to gas line extension at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/gas-line-extension/national-average\n\nThinking about extending a gas line for a new appliance or outdoor grill? This video walks you through every step, from planning and permitting to installation and inspection. Learn what materials you need, how to safely shut off and prep your site, and the right way to install and test your new gas line. We cover essential safety tips, code compliance, and how to avoid common mistakes. Whether you're a homeowner or a contractor, you'll get clear, practical advice to make your project a success. Like and follow for more how-to guides, and check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your contracting business!",
