      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to install water main at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/install-water-main/national-average\n\nIn this video, we break down the full process of installing a new water main, perfect for contractors and homeowners alike. Learn how to plan your project, mark utilities, dig the trench, lay and connect PVC water main pipe, install fittings and valves, and ensure everything is leak-free and up to code. We also cover backfilling, inspection, and site restoration. Whether you're tackling a small residential job or a larger project, these clear steps will help you get it done right. If you found this guide helpful, please like and follow for more construction tips. Contractors\u2014discover how Contractor Plus can streamline your business today!",
