      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to roof ice dam removal at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/roof-ice-dam-removal/national-average\n\nIn this video, we show you exactly how to remove ice dams from your roof and gutters, step by step. Learn what tools and materials you need, how to set up safely, and the best way to melt and clear away ice without damaging your shingles. We cover everything from safety prep and inspection, to using calcium chloride and roof rakes, to cleaning out gutters and checking for roof damage. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, these tips will help you prevent leaks and costly repairs. Like and follow for more home maintenance tips, and if you\u2019re a contractor, check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business.",
