      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to point of entry water filter installation at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/point-of-entry-water-filter-installation/national-average\n\nIn this video, we walk you through the full process of installing a point of entry water filter system for your home. Learn how to shut off your main water supply, cut and prep your pipes, install shut-off valves and mounting brackets, and connect your new filter. We\u2019ll show you how to use the right materials\u2014like copper or PEX piping, fittings, and Teflon tape\u2014to ensure a leak-free setup. Finally, you\u2019ll see how to flush and test your system for clean, reliable water throughout your house. If you found this guide helpful, please like and follow for more tips. Contractors, check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business!",
