        "Want a safe, great-looking playground in just a weekend? Today, I\u2019ll show you how to install playground mulch step by step, so your play area is safe and looks amazing. \n\nFirst, clear the area of all debris, weeds, and old ground cover. Level the ground so it\u2019s smooth and even. Next, roll out weed barrier fabric across the whole space. This stops weeds from growing up through your mulch.\n\nNow, measure and install playground-safe edging around the border. Use stakes or anchors to keep the edging in place. This keeps the mulch from spilling out and helps meet safety standards.\n\nTime for mulch! Arrange delivery of certified playground mulch\u2014wood fiber is a popular choice. Spread it evenly to the recommended depth, especially under swings and slides. Make sure every spot is covered for safety.\n\nFinally, inspect the area. Check that the mulch is deep enough everywhere and the borders are secure. Clean up any leftover materials, and your playground is ready for fun!\n\nIf you liked this video, I appreciate the like and follow. If you're a contractor, come check out Contractor Plus. We've built the ultimate operating system for build and service contractors. Thanks for watching!",
