      name: "How to Demolish a Kitchen: Step-by-Step Guide",
      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to kitchen demolition at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/kitchen-demolition/national-average\n\nThinking about tearing out your old kitchen? This video walks you through every step of a safe and efficient kitchen demolition, from shutting off utilities and protecting your home, to removing cabinets, appliances, flooring, and walls. Learn what tools and materials you\u2019ll need, how to handle debris, and tips for keeping your project on track. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, you\u2019ll get clear instructions to make your kitchen demo smooth and stress-free. Like and follow for more renovation tips, and check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your contracting business!",
