      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to air duct sanitizing at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/air-duct-sanitizing/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn how to sanitize your air ducts safely and effectively. We\u2019ll walk you through every step, from prepping your HVAC system and gathering the right materials, to cleaning and applying disinfectant inside your ductwork. Discover the tools and protective gear you\u2019ll need, how to inspect for mold or debris, and the best way to ensure your home\u2019s air stays clean. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, these tips will help you get the job done right. If you found this guide helpful, don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more home maintenance tips. Contractors, check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business!",
