      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to window lock repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/window-lock-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, we show you exactly how to repair or replace a window lock in just a few easy steps. You\u2019ll learn how to assess the problem, remove the faulty lock, install a new one, and make sure everything works smoothly. We cover the tools and materials you\u2019ll need, including replacement locks, screws, and lubricant. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner looking to boost your home\u2019s security or a contractor wanting a quick refresher, this guide will help you get the job done right. If you found this helpful, don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more DIY and contractor tips. Have questions or want to share your own window repair tips? Drop a comment below!",
