      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to install utility sink faucet at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/install-utility-sink-faucet/national-average\n\nIn this video, you\u2019ll learn how to install a utility sink faucet from start to finish. We\u2019ll cover how to safely shut off your water, remove the old faucet, and install a new one with the right tools and materials. You\u2019ll see how to connect supply lines, use plumber\u2019s putty or Teflon tape to prevent leaks, and test your work for a perfect finish. Whether you\u2019re a DIY homeowner or a contractor looking for a quick refresher, this guide will help you get the job done right. Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more helpful tips, and check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your contracting business!",
