      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to porch screen repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/porch-screen-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn how to repair your porch screen like a pro. We\u2019ll walk you through every step\u2014from removing the old screen and cleaning the frame, to measuring, cutting, and installing new screen mesh. You\u2019ll also see how to use a spline roller for a tight fit and get tips for trimming and securing the edges. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, this guide makes porch screen repair simple and effective. Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more DIY and contractor tips! If you\u2019re a contractor, check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business. Let us know your questions or share your own tips in the comments!",
