      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to underground drain repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/underground-drain-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, we break down the complete process for repairing an underground drain, perfect for both contractors and homeowners. You'll learn how to assess the site, safely excavate, replace damaged PVC drain pipe, and restore the area to its original condition. We cover essential materials like 4\" PVC pipe, couplings, primer, and gravel backfill, plus key safety steps and testing for leaks. Whether you're planning a DIY repair or managing a crew, this guide gives you the confidence to tackle underground drain repairs efficiently and safely. Have questions or tips? Drop them in the comments, and don't forget to like and follow for more expert construction advice!",
