      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to window retrofit installation at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/window-retrofit-installation/national-average\n\nIn this video, you'll learn how to install a retrofit window from start to finish. We cover everything: prepping the site, removing the old window, installing the new retrofit vinyl window, and sealing it for a professional finish. You'll see which materials you need\u2014like caulk, shims, screws, and insulation\u2014and get clear tips for each step. Whether you're a homeowner looking to save on energy bills or a contractor wanting a quick refresher, this guide will help you get the job done right. Have questions or want to share your own tips? Drop a comment below! Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more how-to videos and contractor resources.",
