      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to window sash cord replacement at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/window-sash-cord-replacement/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn how to replace a broken or worn-out window sash cord and restore your old windows to smooth, easy operation. We\u2019ll walk you through removing the sash, cutting out the old cord, threading and attaching a new sash cord, and reassembling the window. You\u2019ll also get tips on choosing the right materials and making sure your window works perfectly when you\u2019re done. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner tackling a DIY project or a contractor looking for a quick refresher, this guide will help you get the job done right. Don\u2019t forget to like, follow, and check out Contractor Plus for more pro tips and tools!",
