      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to gas line replacement at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/gas-line-replacement/national-average\n\nIn this video, we break down the full process of replacing a gas line, from shutting off the gas and removing the old pipe, to installing new CSST gas piping and fittings. You'll learn what materials you need, how to safely assemble and secure the new line, and how to test for leaks before restoring service. Whether you're a homeowner or a contractor, this guide covers the key steps, safety tips, and inspection requirements to help you get the job done right. Have questions or want more tips? Drop a comment below, like, and follow for more expert construction guides. Contractors\u2014discover how Contractor Plus can streamline your business today!",
