      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to stone wall repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/stone-wall-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, we show you exactly how to repair a damaged stone wall, from start to finish. You'll learn how to assess the damage, remove and clean old stones, mix and apply mortar, and finish the job for a seamless look. Whether you're a homeowner tackling a DIY project or a contractor looking for a refresher, this guide covers all the essential steps and tools you need. Don't forget to like and follow for more practical construction tips! If you're a contractor, check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business. Drop your questions or share your own tips in the comments below!",
