      transcript:
        "Want to make your balcony look brand new in just a couple of hours? Today, I\u2019ll show you how to pressure wash your balcony step by step, so you get pro results without the guesswork. \n\nFirst, clear everything off your balcony\u2014move furniture, plants, and any loose items. Sweep away dirt and cover any electrical outlets or surfaces you don\u2019t want to get wet with plastic sheeting and painter\u2019s tape.\n\nNext, mix up your pressure washing detergent according to the label. Apply it evenly to the balcony floor, railings, and walls. Let it sit for a few minutes to break down grime and stains.\n\nNow, grab your pressure washer. Start cleaning the floor, then move to the railings and walls. Work in small sections and keep the nozzle about a foot away from the surface to avoid damage.\n\nWhen you\u2019re done, rinse everything with clean water. Check for any spots you missed and go over them again if needed.\n\nIf you liked this video, I appreciate the like and follow. If you're a contractor, come check out Contractor Plus. We've built the ultimate operating system for build and service contractors. Thanks for watching!",
