        "Calculate materials & costs to christmas light removal at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/christmas-light-removal/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn the best way to remove and store your Christmas lights without damage or hassle. We\u2019ll walk you through unplugging and organizing your supplies, safely taking down lights using the right tools, and inspecting and storing each strand so they\u2019re ready for next year. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, these tips will help you avoid tangles, broken bulbs, and wasted time. Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more helpful guides! Contractors, check out Contractor Plus for the ultimate operating system to run your business more efficiently. Leave a comment if you have questions or want to share your own tips!",
