      name: "How to Repair Stone Steps: DIY Guide for Lasting Results",
      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to stone step repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/stone-step-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, we walk you through every step of repairing damaged stone steps, from assessment to finishing touches. Learn how to safely remove broken stones, clean and prep the area, mix and apply mortar, and set new stone treads for a professional finish. We also cover tips for leveling, joint smoothing, and sealing your repair to keep it looking great for years. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner tackling a DIY project or a contractor looking for a refresher, this guide will help you get the job done right. Don\u2019t forget to like, follow, and share your own stone step repair tips in the comments!",
