        "Calculate materials & costs to deck expansion at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/deck-expansion/national-average\n\nThinking about expanding your deck? This video walks you through every step, from planning and permits to framing, decking, and finishing touches. Learn how to measure your space, choose the right materials, and build a sturdy, safe deck expansion that matches your existing structure. We cover site prep, installing posts and joists, laying deck boards, adding railings and stairs, and making sure your project passes inspection. Whether you're a DIY homeowner or a contractor, you'll get practical tips to make your deck expansion a success. Like and follow for more how-to guides, and check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your contracting business!",
