      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to install utility sink at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/install-utility-sink/national-average\n\nIn this video, we show you exactly how to install a utility sink in your home or workspace. You'll learn how to prepare the site, connect water supply lines, install the drain, and mount the sink securely. We cover all the essential materials you need, including the sink, faucet, P-trap, shutoff valves, and more. Follow along for clear, easy-to-understand steps that help you avoid leaks and common mistakes. Whether you're a DIY homeowner or a contractor, this guide will help you get the job done right. Like and follow for more helpful tips, and check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your contracting business!",
