        "Calculate materials & costs to frozen pipe repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/frozen-pipe-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, we show you exactly how to repair frozen pipes in your home or on the job. Learn how to locate frozen sections, safely thaw pipes without causing damage, and replace any burst or cracked areas using copper pipe, fittings, and insulation. We cover every step, from turning off the water supply to patching drywall, so you can tackle frozen pipe repairs with confidence. Whether you're a homeowner facing a winter emergency or a contractor looking for a reliable process, this guide has you covered. If you found this helpful, please like and follow for more tips. Contractors, check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business!",
