      transcript:
        "Want a stunning granite tile floor that lasts for years? In this video, I\u2019ll show you step-by-step how to install granite tiles like a pro. \n\nFirst, prep your surface. Clean and level the subfloor, fix any damage, and make sure it\u2019s dry and free of dust. This is key for a solid install.\n\nNext, plan your layout. Measure and mark guidelines, then dry-fit your granite tiles. Make any cuts now for a perfect fit.\n\nNow, mix your thinset mortar. Spread it evenly with a notched trowel. Set each tile in place, using spacers for even joints. Work in small sections and let the tiles set undisturbed.\n\nOnce the mortar cures, remove the spacers. Mix and apply grout between the tiles. Wipe away excess grout and clean the tile surface to prevent haze.\n\nFinally, after the grout dries, apply a granite sealer. Inspect your work, make sure all tiles are secure, and enjoy your new floor!\n\nIf you liked this video, I appreciate the like and follow. If you're a contractor, come check out Contractor Plus. We've built the ultimate operating system for build and service contractors. Thanks for watching!",
