      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to sprinkler system maintenance at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/sprinkler-system-maintenance/national-average\n\nIn this video, we walk you through a complete sprinkler system maintenance routine. Learn how to inspect your system for leaks and damage, clean and adjust sprinkler heads, make essential repairs, and update your irrigation controller for the season. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, these clear steps will help you keep your lawn healthy and your water bills low. Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more helpful tips! Contractors, discover how Contractor Plus can streamline your business and make every job easier. Watch now and keep your sprinklers running smoothly all year long!",
