        "https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/mold-assessment/national-average",
      transcript:
        "Did you know hidden mold can threaten your health and your home's value? In this video, you'll learn how to do a complete mold assessment step by step. \n\nFirst, gather your materials: three mold test kits for air and surfaces, a set of personal protective equipment, a moisture meter (rent for a day), and three lab analyses for your samples. This covers about 2,000 square feet.\n\nStart with an initial inspection. Spend about an hour checking every area\u2014especially basements, bathrooms, and around windows\u2014for visible mold, moisture, or musty smells.\n\nNext, use your moisture meter and air test kits. Take readings in all suspect areas. Record everything carefully for later review.\n\nThen, document your findings. Take clear photos of any mold or water damage. Analyze your test results to see how bad the problem is.\n\nFinally, prepare a report. List your findings, any health risks, and what steps you recommend to fix the issue. Go over this report with anyone involved.\n\nIf you liked this video, I appreciate the like and follow. If you're a contractor, come check out Contractor Plus. We've built the ultimate operating system for build and service contractors. Thanks for watching!",
