      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to toilet water line installation at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/toilet-water-line-installation/national-average\n\nIn this video, you\u2019ll learn how to install a new toilet water supply line quickly and safely. We\u2019ll cover every step, from shutting off the water and removing the old line, to connecting the new flexible supply line and checking for leaks. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner tackling your first plumbing project or a contractor looking for a quick refresher, this guide will help you get the job done right. Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more helpful how-to videos. Contractors, check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business. Drop your questions or tips in the comments below!",
