        "Calculate materials & costs to replace galvanized pipes at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/replace-galvanized-pipes/national-average\n\nIn this video, we show you exactly how to replace old galvanized pipes with modern PEX piping. You'll learn how to safely shut off your water, remove old pipes, install new PEX lines, and test your system for leaks. We cover all the materials you need\u2014like PEX pipe, fittings, crimp rings, insulation, and more\u2014plus tips for a smooth installation. Whether you're a homeowner or a contractor, this guide will help you avoid common mistakes and get the job done right. Have questions or want more tips? Drop a comment below, like, and follow for more how-to videos. Contractors, check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business!",
