      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to architrave installation at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/architrave-installation/national-average\n\nIn this video, we walk you through the complete process of installing architrave molding around doors or windows. You'll learn how to measure and cut your architrave for perfect joints, prepare your surfaces, and secure the molding for a professional finish. We also cover filling, sanding, and prepping for paint, so your project looks flawless. Whether you're a DIY homeowner or a contractor looking to refresh your skills, this guide makes the process simple and clear. Have questions or tips? Drop them in the comments! Like and follow for more practical construction tutorials, and discover how Contractor Plus can help you manage your next project with ease.",
