      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to replace outdoor outlet at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/replace-outdoor-outlet/national-average\n\nIn this video, you'll learn step-by-step how to replace an outdoor electrical outlet with a weather-resistant GFCI model. We cover everything from shutting off the power and removing the old outlet, to wiring the new outlet and installing a weatherproof cover. You'll also get tips on using the right materials, like exterior-rated boxes and proper wire connectors, to ensure a safe and long-lasting installation. Whether you're a homeowner or a contractor, this guide will help you complete the job with confidence. Have questions or want more tips? Drop a comment below, like, and follow for more how-to videos!",
