      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to thermostat not cooling at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/thermostat-not-cooling/national-average\n\nIs your thermostat not cooling your home? In this video, we walk you through a simple, step-by-step process to troubleshoot and fix a thermostat that's not working right. Learn how to check your thermostat settings, replace batteries, inspect wiring, and make sure your HVAC system is running smoothly. We also cover how to clear debris from your outdoor unit and test your system for proper cooling. Whether you're a homeowner or a contractor, these tips will help you get your cooling system back on track. Like and follow for more helpful guides, and contractors\u2014discover how Contractor Plus can streamline your business today!",
