        "Calculate materials & costs to hexagon tile installation at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/hexagon-tile-installation/national-average\n\nIn this video, we break down the complete process for installing hexagon tile floors, from surface prep to sealing. Learn how to clean and level your subfloor, plan your tile layout, apply thinset mortar, set and space your tiles, grout, and finish with a protective sealer. Whether you\u2019re a DIY homeowner or a contractor, these clear steps will help you achieve a professional-looking tile floor that lasts. Got questions or tips? Drop them in the comments! Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more how-to guides. Contractors\u2014discover how Contractor Plus can streamline your business today!",
