        "Calculate materials & costs to install bathroom lighting at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/install-bathroom-lighting/national-average\n\nIn this video, we show you exactly how to install a new bathroom light fixture, from turning off the power to testing your new light. You'll learn how to safely remove an old fixture, prepare and connect wiring, and mount your new light\u2014all with easy-to-follow steps. Whether you're a homeowner tackling your first lighting project or a contractor looking for a quick refresher, this guide covers the tools, materials, and safety tips you need. Have questions or want more DIY tips? Drop a comment below, like, and follow for more home improvement videos. Contractors\u2014discover how Contractor Plus can help you run your business smarter!",
