      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to underground pipe repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/underground-pipe-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, we break down the entire process of repairing a damaged underground PVC pipe. You'll learn how to locate and expose the leak, safely remove the broken section, and install new pipe and fittings that meet code. We cover essential materials like PVC pipe, couplings, primer, cement, gravel backfill, and warning tape, plus tips for testing and backfilling the trench to prevent future problems. Whether you're a homeowner tackling a DIY repair or a contractor looking for a refresher, this guide will help you get the job done right. Like and follow for more how-to videos, and visit Contractor Plus for the best tools and resources for contractors!",
