      name: "How to Repoint Stone Walls: Step-by-Step Guide",
      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to repointing stone at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/repointing-stone/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn how to repoint stone walls for a fresh, long-lasting finish. We cover every step: removing old mortar, cleaning the stone, mixing the right mortar, applying it for a perfect match, and curing for durability. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, you\u2019ll get clear, practical tips to make your stonework look new again. Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more expert construction guides! Contractors\u2014discover how Contractor Plus can streamline your business and help you win more jobs. Drop your questions or share your own tips in the comments below!",
      thumbnailUrl:
        "https://contractor-plus-website.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/og-images/d8122841-366a-4008-a3a9-86df85e6ea87.jpg",
