        "Ready to give your floors a fresh new look in just one day? In this video, you'll learn exactly how to replace laminate flooring step by step, from prep to finish. \n\nFirst, clear out all furniture and remove the baseboards. Pull up the old flooring and check the subfloor for any damage or uneven spots. Clean it well\u2014this is key for a smooth install.\n\nNext, roll out your underlayment across the entire floor. Trim it to fit the space and tape the seams. This helps with moisture and sound control.\n\nNow, start laying your laminate planks. Stagger the joints for strength and always leave a small gap along the walls for expansion. Cut planks to fit around corners, doorways, and any obstacles.\n\nOnce all planks are down, reinstall your baseboards to cover the expansion gaps. Give the floor a good clean and dispose of old materials properly.\n\nIf you liked this video, I appreciate the like and follow. If you're a contractor, come check out Contractor Plus. We've built the ultimate operating system for build and service contractors. Thanks for watching!",
