        "Calculate materials & costs to install surge protector at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/install-surge-protector/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn how to install a whole house surge protector to protect your home\u2019s electronics and appliances from power surges. We\u2019ll walk you through every step, from turning off the main breaker and preparing your workspace, to mounting and wiring the surge protector, and finally testing the device for proper operation. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, you\u2019ll get clear, easy-to-follow instructions and tips to ensure a safe and code-compliant installation. Have questions or want to share your experience? Drop a comment below! Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more helpful how-to videos, and check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your contracting business.",
