      name: "How to Replace a Water Main: Step-by-Step Guide",
      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to replace water main at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/replace-water-main/national-average\n\nIn this video, we break down the full process of replacing a 1-inch copper water main, from shutting off the supply to final inspection. You'll learn what materials you need\u2014like copper pipe, brass fittings, shutoff valves, insulation, and trenching materials\u2014and how much time each step takes. We cover excavation, pipe installation, pressure testing, backfilling, and restoring your property. Whether you're a contractor or a homeowner, this guide will help you understand the workflow and avoid common mistakes. Have questions or tips? Drop them in the comments! Like and follow for more practical construction guides, and check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your contracting business.",
