      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to kitchen lighting installation at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/kitchen-lighting-installation/national-average\n\nReady to upgrade your kitchen lighting? This video walks you through every step of installing recessed LED lights in your kitchen, from turning off the power and removing old fixtures to wiring, mounting, and testing your new lights. We cover the exact materials you'll need, including wire, switches, and connectors, and explain how to safely connect everything for a professional finish. Whether you're a DIY homeowner or a contractor, you'll get clear, practical tips to make your kitchen brighter and more energy-efficient. Have questions or want more tips? Drop a comment below, like, and follow for more home improvement guides. Contractors\u2014discover how Contractor Plus can streamline your business today!",
