        "Want a luxury shower experience in under two hours? Today, I\u2019ll show you how to install a rain shower head, step by step. \n\nFirst, turn off the water. Use a wrench to unscrew your old shower head. Clean the threads on the shower arm\u2014this helps the new head seal tight.\n\nNext, wrap plumber\u2019s tape around the shower arm threads. This keeps water from leaking. You can also use a dab of pipe dope for extra protection.\n\nNow, screw on your new rain shower head by hand. Use a wrench to gently tighten it\u2014don\u2019t overdo it, or you could crack the fitting. Adjust the angle so the water falls just right.\n\nTurn the water back on. Check for leaks around the connection. If you see drips, tighten a bit more or add more tape. Make sure the water flows evenly from the shower head.\n\nThat\u2019s it! You\u2019ve upgraded your shower in just a few easy steps. If you liked this video, I appreciate the like and follow. If you're a contractor, come check out Contractor Plus. We've built the ultimate operating system for build and service contractors. Thanks for watching!",
