      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to radon mitigation system testing at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/radon-mitigation-system-testing/national-average\n\nIn this video, we show you exactly how to test your radon mitigation system at home or on the job. Learn how to prepare your space, set up a radon test kit or digital monitor, and get accurate results that help keep your home safe from radon gas. We break down each step, from closing windows and doors to sending your test to a certified lab or reading your digital monitor. Whether you're a homeowner or a contractor, this guide makes radon testing simple and clear. Have questions or tips? Drop them in the comments! Don\u2019t forget to like, follow, and check out Contractor Plus for more contractor resources and tools.",
