      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to pipe patching at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/pipe-patching/national-average\n\nIn this video, we show you exactly how to patch a leaking or damaged pipe\u2014no plumbing experience needed! Learn how to locate the leak, prepare the pipe surface, and apply a patch or repair clamp using affordable materials like pipe patch kits, epoxy, and sandpaper. We break down each step, from shutting off the water to testing your repair, so you can tackle pipe leaks with confidence. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner looking to save on repairs or a contractor wanting a quick refresher, this guide has you covered. Got questions or tips? Drop them in the comments! Don\u2019t forget to like, follow, and check out Contractor Plus for more pro resources and tools.",
