      name: "How to Clean Supply Vents for Better Air Quality",
      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to supply vent cleaning at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/supply-vent-cleaning/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn how to clean your supply vents step by step for a healthier home and improved HVAC efficiency. We\u2019ll cover everything you need: from turning off your system and gathering supplies, to removing vent covers, vacuuming dust, cleaning inside the ducts, and reassembling everything safely. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, these tips will help you get the job done right. Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more practical how-tos! Contractors\u2014discover how Contractor Plus can streamline your business with the ultimate operating system for build and service pros. Leave your questions or tips in the comments below!",
