      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to roof ridge cap repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/roof-ridge-cap-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, we show you exactly how to repair a roof ridge cap, from inspection to final sealing. You'll learn what tools and materials you need, how to safely remove damaged ridge cap shingles, and the right way to install new ones for a watertight finish. Whether you're a homeowner tackling a DIY project or a contractor looking for a quick refresher, this guide covers every step clearly and simply. Don't let a leaky ridge cap cause bigger problems\u2014watch now to protect your roof and your home. If you found this helpful, please like and follow for more tips. Contractors, check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business!",
