      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to upgrade light switch at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/upgrade-light-switch/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn how to upgrade a single pole light switch quickly and safely. We\u2019ll walk you through every step, from turning off the power and removing the old switch, to prepping the wires and installing your new switch. You\u2019ll also get tips on what materials you need, how to check for safe wiring, and how to test your new switch when you\u2019re done. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, this guide makes the process simple and stress-free. If you found this helpful, hit like and follow for more DIY and contractor tips. Contractors, don\u2019t forget to check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business!",
