      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to sprinkler controller repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/sprinkler-controller-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, you\u2019ll learn how to repair or replace a faulty sprinkler controller step-by-step. We\u2019ll cover how to safely power down your system, inspect for damage, test components with a multimeter, and swap out any bad parts. You\u2019ll also see how to reprogram your controller and test each sprinkler zone to make sure everything works perfectly. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, these clear instructions will help you get your irrigation system back up and running fast. Have questions or tips? Drop them in the comments! Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more helpful repair guides.",
