        "Want to make your outdoor space look amazing with new tile? In this video, I\u2019ll show you how to install outdoor tile step by step, so you get pro results that last.\n\nFirst, prep your surface. Clean the area, remove debris, and make sure it\u2019s level. Check for proper drainage. If needed, apply an outdoor primer.\n\nNext, plan your layout. Mark guidelines and dry-fit your tiles. This helps you avoid small cuts and keeps everything straight.\n\nNow, mix your exterior-grade thinset mortar. Spread it in small sections. Set each tile in place, using spacers for even joints. Work carefully and check your lines as you go.\n\nOnce the mortar sets, it\u2019s time to grout. Fill the joints with outdoor-rated grout. Wipe away extra grout and clean the tile faces.\n\nLet everything cure for at least 8 hours. Inspect for loose tiles or gaps. If needed, seal the grout to protect against weather.\n\nIf you liked this video, I appreciate the like and follow. If you're a contractor, come check out Contractor Plus. We've built the ultimate operating system for build and service contractors. Thanks for watching!",
