      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to sprinkler wiring repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/sprinkler-wiring-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, we show you exactly how to repair or replace damaged sprinkler wiring in your yard. You'll learn how to safely turn off your system, identify faulty wires with a multimeter, and make waterproof connections using the right materials. We cover every step, from exposing and labeling wires to testing each sprinkler zone after repairs. Whether you're a homeowner or a contractor, these clear instructions will help you restore your irrigation system quickly and safely. Have questions or tips? Drop them in the comments! Like and follow for more practical repair guides, and check out Contractor Plus for the best contractor tools and resources.",
