      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to well cap repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/well-cap-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn how to repair or replace a well cap to keep your water supply safe and clean. We\u2019ll walk you through every step\u2014from shutting off power and inspecting the cap, to cleaning, repairing, or installing a new well cap, and restoring your system. You\u2019ll find out what tools and materials you need, how to spot common problems, and how to make sure your well stays sealed against contamination. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, these tips will help you do the job right. Have questions or want to share your experience? Drop a comment below! Don\u2019t forget to like, follow, and check out Contractor Plus for more pro tips and tools.",
