      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to mold removal from air ducts at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/mold-removal-from-air-ducts/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn how to safely and effectively remove mold from your air ducts. We cover everything from inspection and preparation, to cleaning with EPA-approved products, and finishing with proper sanitization and drying. You\u2019ll see what tools and materials you need, how to protect yourself, and tips to prevent mold from coming back. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, these clear steps will help you tackle mold in your ductwork with confidence. Got questions or tips? Drop them in the comments, and don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more expert guides!",
