      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to deck post replacement at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/deck-post-replacement/national-average\n\nIn this video, we show you exactly how to replace a damaged or rotting deck post. You\u2019ll learn how to safely remove the old post, prepare the footing, and install a new pressure-treated 4x4 post using the right hardware and materials. We cover every step, from detaching railings to setting the post plumb and reconnecting your deck structure. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner tackling a DIY project or a contractor looking for a quick refresher, this guide will help you get the job done right. Have questions or tips? Drop them in the comments! Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more practical construction how-tos.",
