      name: "How to Repair Brick Veneer: Step-by-Step Guide",
      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to brick veneer repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/brick-veneer-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, we show you exactly how to repair damaged brick veneer on your home or building. Learn how to safely remove broken bricks, mix and apply fresh mortar, set new bricks to match your existing wall, and finish with a professional look. We cover every step, from surface prep to cleanup and sealing, so you can tackle this project with confidence. Whether you're a homeowner or a contractor, these tips will help you get durable, long-lasting results. Have questions or want to share your own tips? Drop a comment below! Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more practical construction guides.",
