      name: "How to Fix a Burst Pipe Fast: Emergency Repair Guide",
      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to emergency burst pipe repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/emergency-burst-pipe-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, we show you exactly how to handle an emergency burst pipe repair, step by step. Learn how to quickly shut off your water, assess the damage, drain and prep the area, and make a temporary repair using the right tools and materials. We cover everything from cutting out the damaged pipe to installing a slip coupling or repair clamp, and testing your fix to make sure there are no leaks. Whether you're a homeowner facing a plumbing emergency or a contractor looking for a quick refresher, this guide will help you act fast and prevent further water damage. Like and follow for more tips, and check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your contracting business!",
