      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to garage door torsion spring installation at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/garage-door-torsion-spring-installation/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn how to safely replace a garage door torsion spring from start to finish. We cover every step: safety prep, removing the old spring, installing the new one, and testing your garage door for smooth operation. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner tackling a DIY project or a contractor looking for a quick refresher, this guide will help you get the job done right. Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more helpful tips, and if you\u2019re a contractor, check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business. Drop your questions or experiences in the comments below!",
