      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to build floating floor at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/build-floating-floor/national-average\n\nIn this video, we show you exactly how to build a floating floor, from preparing your subfloor to installing underlayment, snapping together planks, and adding finishing touches like trim and transition strips. Whether you\u2019re a DIY homeowner or a contractor, you\u2019ll learn the key steps to get a professional-looking floating floor that lasts. We cover tips for leveling, moisture protection, and making sure your floor looks great and stays stable. If you found this guide helpful, please like and follow for more home improvement tips. Contractors, don\u2019t forget to check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business!",
