      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to water heater drain valve replacement at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/water-heater-drain-valve-replacement/national-average\n\nIn this video, you\u2019ll learn how to replace a water heater drain valve quickly and safely, whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor. We\u2019ll cover every step, from shutting off your water heater and draining the tank, to removing the old valve, installing a new one with Teflon tape, and testing for leaks. You\u2019ll also get tips on what tools and materials you need, and how to avoid common mistakes. If you found this guide helpful, please like and follow for more DIY and contractor tips. Contractors, don\u2019t forget to check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business. Drop your questions or experiences in the comments below!",
