      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to brick walkway installation at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/brick-walkway-installation/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn how to install a brick walkway from start to finish. We cover everything: marking your layout, excavating, adding a solid gravel and sand base, laying bricks in a neat pattern, and finishing with sand and edging. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, you\u2019ll get clear, easy-to-follow steps and pro tips for a walkway that looks great and lasts. Have questions or want to share your own tips? Drop a comment below! Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more how-to guides. Contractors\u2014discover how Contractor Plus can help you run your business smarter and faster.",
