      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to toilet seal installation at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/toilet-seal-installation/national-average\n\nIn this video, you\u2019ll learn how to replace a toilet seal to stop leaks and prevent water damage. We\u2019ll walk you through every step, from shutting off the water and removing the toilet, to installing a new wax ring and testing for leaks. You\u2019ll also get tips on which materials you need, how to clean the flange, and how to reinstall your toilet safely. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner tackling your first repair or a contractor looking for a quick refresher, this guide will help you get the job done right. If you found this helpful, please like and follow for more DIY and contractor tips. Contractors, don\u2019t forget to check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business!",
      thumbnailUrl:
        "https://contractor-plus-website.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/og-images/bc16086e-9357-4d91-9e48-04d65d96e77b.jpg",
