        "Want to know exactly how to remodel a bathroom, step by step? In this video, you'll learn the full process, from demolition to the final inspection, so you can tackle your bathroom remodel with confidence.\n\nFirst, start with demolition and site prep. Remove old fixtures, tiles, and cabinets. Protect nearby rooms and safely dispose of debris.\n\nNext, upgrade your plumbing and electrical. Update water lines and wiring for new fixtures and lighting. Always follow your local building codes.\n\nNow, install new surfaces. Hang drywall, put up waterproof backer board, and lay ceramic tile on the floor and shower walls. Use grout and thinset, and let everything cure properly.\n\nAfter that, install your new fixtures and cabinets. Set the bathtub or shower, toilet, vanity, and connect all plumbing and electrical parts. Make sure everything is tight and leak-free.\n\nFinally, add finishing touches. Caulk, paint, install mirrors, lights, and accessories. Do a full inspection to make sure everything meets code, then clean up the site.\n\nIf you liked this video, I appreciate the like and follow. If you're a contractor, come check out Contractor Plus. We've built the ultimate operating system for build and service contractors. Thanks for watching!",
