      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to drain pipe relining at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/drain-pipe-relining/national-average\n\nIn this video, we break down the entire drain pipe relining process so you can repair damaged pipes without digging up your property. Learn how to inspect your drain pipe with a camera, clean it thoroughly, prepare and insert the epoxy liner, and ensure a proper cure for long-lasting results. We cover the essential materials, tools, and time needed for each step, making it easy for homeowners and contractors alike. If you want to save time, money, and hassle on your next pipe repair, this guide is for you. Don\u2019t forget to like, follow, and check out Contractor Plus for more pro tips and resources!",
