      name: "How to Thaw Frozen Pipes Safely and Prevent Damage",
      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to pipe thawing at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/pipe-thawing/national-average\n\nIn this video, we show you step-by-step how to safely thaw frozen pipes and avoid costly water damage. Learn how to spot which pipes are frozen, the safest ways to thaw them using common household tools, and how to check your plumbing for leaks after restoring water. We also share tips on preventing pipes from freezing again, including insulation and heat tape. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, these tips will help you handle frozen pipes quickly and safely. If you found this guide helpful, please like and follow for more home repair tips. Contractors, discover how Contractor Plus can streamline your business today!",
