      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to drain hydro jetting at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/drain-hydro-jetting/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn how to hydro jet a drain safely and effectively. We\u2019ll walk you through the entire process\u2014from initial inspection and setup, to using a hydro jetting machine, and finally testing and cleaning up. Discover what tools and materials you need, how much water to prepare, and the best safety practices for tackling tough drain clogs. Whether you\u2019re a contractor or a homeowner, you\u2019ll get clear, practical tips to get the job done right. Have questions or want to share your own tips? Drop a comment below! Don\u2019t forget to like, follow, and check out Contractor Plus for more pro resources.",
