      transcript:
        "Are your trees looking sick and you\u2019re not sure what to do? In this video, you\u2019ll learn how to treat tree diseases step by step, so you can save your trees and protect your yard. \n\nFirst, inspect your trees closely. Look for spots, wilting, or odd growth. Use a guidebook or ask an expert to identify the disease. This helps you pick the right treatment.\n\nNext, grab your gloves and mask. Prune away any diseased branches. Remove all infected leaves and debris from around the tree. Always disinfect your tools between cuts to stop the disease from spreading.\n\nNow, it\u2019s time to treat. Use a systemic fungicide or insecticide if needed. Follow the label for how much to use and how to apply it. A tree injection kit can help get the treatment inside the tree. Always wear protective gear.\n\nFinally, clean up. Throw away all infected material according to your local rules. Add mulch and water the tree properly to help it recover and prevent future problems.\n\nIf you liked this video, I appreciate the like and follow. If you're a contractor, come check out Contractor Plus. We've built the ultimate operating system for build and service contractors. Thanks for watching!",
