      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to spa insulation at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/spa-insulation/national-average\n\nIn this video, we show you exactly how to insulate your spa to save energy and money. Learn how to prepare your site, inspect and clean your spa, apply closed cell spray foam insulation and a vapor barrier, and seal everything up for maximum efficiency. We cover each step in detail, so you can do it yourself or know what to expect from a contractor. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a pro, these tips will help you get the job done right. Like and follow for more helpful guides, and check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your contracting business!",
