        "Calculate materials & costs to install shower enclosure at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/install-shower-enclosure/national-average\n\nReady to give your bathroom a modern upgrade? In this video, we walk you through the entire process of installing a shower enclosure, from prepping your space to sealing the final joints. Learn how to measure and mark for the frame, install the base and glass panels, and apply waterproof caulk for a leak-free finish. Whether you\u2019re a DIY homeowner or a contractor looking for a refresher, these clear, easy-to-follow steps will help you get professional results. Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more helpful tips, and if you\u2019re a contractor, check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business!",
