      transcript:
        "Want to upgrade your bathroom with a sleek new shower enclosure? In this video, I\u2019ll show you step-by-step how to install a shower enclosure like a pro. \n\nFirst, clear out your work area. Remove any old enclosure or debris, and make sure the walls and floor are clean, level, and dry. This helps everything fit right and last longer.\n\nNext, measure and mark where the frame will go on your shower walls. Install the base track, then secure the vertical framing pieces. Always follow the manufacturer\u2019s instructions for your specific kit.\n\nNow, it\u2019s time for the glass panels. Carefully lift each panel into place and secure it in the frame. Double-check that everything is level and the door opens smoothly. Tighten all fasteners, but don\u2019t overtighten\u2014glass can crack.\n\nFinally, seal all the joints and edges with waterproof silicone caulk. Wipe away any extra, let it cure, and clean the glass and hardware. Inspect for leaks or gaps before you\u2019re done.\n\nIf you liked this video, I appreciate the like and follow. If you're a contractor, come check out Contractor Plus. We've built the ultimate operating system for build and service contractors. Thanks for watching!",
