      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to pressure washing steps at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/pressure-washing-steps/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn how to pressure wash your steps like a pro. We cover everything you need to know\u2014from prepping the area and protecting nearby surfaces, to setting up your pressure washer and choosing the right detergent. Follow our step-by-step guide to safely remove dirt, grime, and stains, leaving your steps looking brand new. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, these tips will help you get the job done quickly and efficiently. Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more helpful how-to videos, and check out Contractor Plus for the best tools and resources for contractors!",
