      name: "How to Do Construction Staking: Step-by-Step Guide",
      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to construction staking at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/construction-staking/national-average\n\nIn this video, we break down the entire construction staking process so you can lay out your project with confidence. Learn how to review site plans, set up control points, place stakes accurately, and document your work for inspections. Whether you're a contractor or a homeowner tackling a new build, these clear steps will help you avoid costly mistakes and keep your project on track. Have questions or tips about construction staking? Drop them in the comments! Don\u2019t forget to like, follow, and check out Contractor Plus for more tools and resources to make your next project a success.",
