      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to soundproofing pipes at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/soundproofing-pipes/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn how to soundproof noisy pipes in your home or building. We\u2019ll walk you through every step\u2014from inspecting and cleaning your pipes, to wrapping them with acoustic insulation, sealing gaps with caulk, and building soundproof enclosures for extra noise control. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner tired of rattling pipes or a contractor looking for a professional finish, this guide covers the tools, materials, and techniques you need. Have questions or tips? Drop them in the comments! Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more practical construction how-tos. Contractors, check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business.",
