      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to chimney construction at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/chimney-construction/national-average\n\nIn this video, we break down the entire chimney construction process, from preparing the site and pouring a solid foundation to laying bricks, installing flue liners, and finishing with a weatherproof cap and flashing. Whether you're a homeowner planning a DIY project or a contractor looking for a clear workflow, you'll get practical tips on materials, labor, and best practices for a safe, code-compliant chimney. Watch to learn how to avoid common mistakes and ensure your chimney stands the test of time. Like, follow, and share your questions or experiences in the comments below!",
