      embedUrl:
        "https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/installing-instant-lawn/national-average",
      transcript:
        "Want a lush green lawn in just one day? Here\u2019s how to install instant lawn sod like a pro. In this video, you\u2019ll learn the step-by-step process to get a perfect, healthy lawn fast.\n\nFirst, clear your yard. Remove all debris and old grass. Level the soil and make sure water drains away from your house. Rake the area smooth\u2014this is key for even growth.\n\nNext, spread a layer of topsoil if your soil is poor. Sprinkle starter fertilizer evenly across the area. Use a roller to compact the soil. This gives your new lawn a firm, even base.\n\nNow, unroll the instant lawn sod. Lay each roll tightly against the next, staggering the seams like bricks. Trim the edges to fit. Press down on the sod so it touches the soil underneath\u2014good contact helps roots grow fast.\n\nWater the new lawn right away. Soak it deeply. Check for gaps or uneven spots and fix them. Clean up any leftover soil and tools. Keep the lawn moist for the first week to help it settle in.\n\nIf you liked this video, I appreciate the like and follow. If you're a contractor, come check out Contractor Plus. We've built the ultimate operating system for build and service contractors. Thanks for watching!",
