        "Calculate materials & costs to spa removal at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/spa-removal/national-average\n\nThinking about removing an old spa from your backyard or job site? This video walks you through the entire spa removal process, from disconnecting utilities to hauling away debris. Learn what tools and safety gear you need, how to safely drain and disassemble the spa, and tips for efficient cleanup. Whether you're a homeowner tackling a DIY project or a contractor looking for best practices, this guide covers everything you need to know. Don't forget to like and follow for more helpful construction tips, and check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your contracting business!",
