      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to well water line installation at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/well-water-line-installation/national-average\n\nIn this video, we break down the complete process for installing a well water line\u2014from planning and trenching to connecting and testing. You'll learn how to mark your route, dig the right trench, lay 1\" polyethylene pipe, and make secure connections with brass fittings. We also cover pressure testing and proper backfilling to ensure a leak-free, long-lasting installation. Whether you're a contractor or a DIY homeowner, these clear steps will help you get the job done right and up to code. Have questions or tips? Drop them in the comments! Like and follow for more expert construction guides, and check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your contracting business.",
