      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to repair light switch at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/repair-light-switch/national-average\n\nIn this video, you\u2019ll learn how to repair or replace a single pole light switch safely and efficiently. We\u2019ll walk you through turning off the power, removing the cover plate, inspecting and replacing the switch, and testing your work. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, these clear steps will help you get the job done right the first time. Don\u2019t forget to use the right materials, like a new switch, cover plate, wire connectors, and electrical tape. If you found this guide helpful, please like and follow for more DIY and contractor tips. Contractors, check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business. Let us know your questions or share your own tips in the comments!",
