      name: "How to Repair Cracks in Stone: Step-by-Step Guide",
      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to stone crack repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/stone-crack-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, you\u2019ll learn how to repair cracks in stone surfaces using simple tools and materials. We\u2019ll walk you through cleaning, prepping, filling, and finishing the crack so your stone looks as good as new. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner tackling a DIY project or a contractor looking for a reliable process, this guide covers everything you need to know. We\u2019ll also share tips on choosing the right filler and getting a seamless finish. Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more practical repair tips! Contractors, check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business. Drop your questions or experiences in the comments below!",
      thumbnailUrl:
        "https://contractor-plus-website.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/og-images/41f6759e-390a-4a46-a5d2-765b561e382c.jpg",
      uploadDate: "2025-08-04",
      duration: "PT2M30S",
