      name: "How to Build a Safe Backyard Sandbox: Step-by-Step Guide",
      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to sandbox installation at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/sandbox-installation/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn how to install a durable and safe backyard sandbox from start to finish. We cover everything: choosing the right location, preparing the ground, assembling a sturdy frame with pressure-treated lumber, installing a weed barrier, and filling with clean play sand. You\u2019ll also get tips on safety checks and finishing touches to keep kids safe and your sandbox looking great. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, this guide makes the process simple and clear. Like and follow for more DIY and contractor tips, and visit Contractor Plus for the best tools to manage your construction business!",
