      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to stone patio repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/stone-patio-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, we walk you through the complete process of repairing a stone patio, from assessing damage to finishing touches. Learn how to remove damaged stones, level the base with gravel or sand, reset new or existing stones, and fill joints for a smooth, long-lasting finish. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner tackling a DIY project or a contractor looking for best practices, this guide covers all the essential steps and materials you\u2019ll need. Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more helpful tips, and if you\u2019re a contractor, check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business. Drop your questions or share your own patio repair tips in the comments below!",
