      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to replace central air conditioning unit at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/replace-central-air-conditioning-unit/national-average\n\nIn this video, we walk you through the full process of replacing a central air conditioning unit, from shutting down the old system to installing and testing the new one. Learn what materials you\u2019ll need, how to safely disconnect and remove the old unit, and the right way to install and charge your new air conditioner. We also cover important safety tips, code requirements, and how to ensure your system runs efficiently. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, this guide will help you tackle the job with confidence. Like and follow for more how-to videos, and visit Contractor Plus for the best tools and resources for contractors!",
