      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to brick step repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/brick-step-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, we show you exactly how to repair damaged brick steps, from start to finish. Learn how to prep your site, remove old bricks and mortar, install new bricks, and finish the job for a professional look. We cover the tools and materials you\u2019ll need, including replacement bricks, mortar mix, bonding agent, and more. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner tackling a DIY project or a contractor looking for a refresher, this guide will help you restore your steps safely and efficiently. Have questions or tips? Drop them in the comments! Don\u2019t forget to like, follow, and check out Contractor Plus for more contractor resources and tools.",
