      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to partition wall framing at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/partition-wall-framing/national-average\n\nIn this video, we walk you through the complete process of framing a partition wall, from layout and marking to final inspection and cleanup. Learn how to measure and mark your wall location, install bottom and top plates, cut and place studs, and frame doorways with the right materials and tools. Whether you\u2019re a DIY homeowner or a professional contractor, these clear steps will help you build a straight, secure partition wall ready for drywall. Got questions or tips? Drop them in the comments! Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more construction how-tos, and check out Contractor Plus for the best contractor tools and resources.",
