      name: "How to Soundproof Your Bathroom: Step-by-Step Guide",
      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to soundproofing bathroom at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/soundproofing-bathroom/national-average\n\nIn this video, you'll learn exactly how to soundproof your bathroom for maximum privacy and comfort. We cover every step, from inspecting and preparing surfaces, to installing acoustic insulation, resilient channels, and soundproof drywall. You'll also see how to seal doors with weatherstripping and door sweeps, and how to address plumbing and ventilation noise. Whether you're a homeowner or a contractor, these clear instructions will help you achieve professional results. Have questions or tips? Drop them in the comments! Like and follow for more practical construction guides, and check out Contractor Plus for the best contractor tools and resources.",
