      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to build concrete floor at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/build-concrete-floor/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn how to build a durable concrete floor from start to finish. We cover every step: site prep, setting forms, adding a gravel base, installing a vapor barrier, placing rebar or wire mesh, pouring and leveling concrete, and finishing for long-lasting results. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, you\u2019ll get clear, practical tips to ensure your concrete floor is strong and crack-resistant. Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more construction how-tos! Contractors\u2014discover how Contractor Plus can streamline your business and help you win more jobs.",
      thumbnailUrl:
        "https://contractor-plus-website.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/og-images/0e871453-a0a1-4fda-a11c-8d1bf1e4c003.jpg",
