      name: "How to Repair a Well Casing: Step-by-Step Guide",
      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to well casing repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/well-casing-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, we break down the full process of repairing a well casing, from site prep to final testing. You'll learn how to safely expose and inspect your well casing, remove and replace damaged sections, seal joints to prevent contamination, and restore your well to working order. We cover the essential materials\u2014like steel casing, couplings, sealant, and well caps\u2014and explain each step in plain English. Whether you're a contractor or a homeowner, this guide will help you keep your water supply safe and reliable. Have questions or tips? Drop them in the comments, and don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more contractor how-tos!",
