      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to hot tub filter installation at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/hot-tub-filter-installation/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn how to install a new filter in your hot tub for cleaner, safer water. We\u2019ll walk you through every step, from turning off the power and removing the old filter, to cleaning the housing and installing the new cartridge. You\u2019ll also see how to check and replace the O-ring, use Teflon tape for a tight seal, and test your system for leaks. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, these tips will help you keep your hot tub running smoothly. Have questions or tips of your own? Drop them in the comments! Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more helpful guides, and check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your contracting business.",
