      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to emergency gas line repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/emergency-gas-line-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, we walk you through the step-by-step process of emergency gas line repair. Learn how to safely shut off the gas, locate and remove the damaged section, install new black iron gas pipe with the right fittings and sealant, and test for leaks before restoring service. We cover the essential tools and materials you\u2019ll need, plus key safety tips to keep your home or job site secure. Whether you\u2019re a contractor or a homeowner, this guide will help you handle gas line emergencies with confidence. Have questions or tips? Drop them in the comments, and don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more expert construction advice!",
