      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to masonry waterproofing at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/masonry-waterproofing/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn how to waterproof masonry walls the right way. We\u2019ll walk you through every step, from cleaning and prepping the surface, repairing cracks, taping off edges, applying a high-quality waterproofing sealer, to final inspection and cleanup. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, these tips will help you protect your brick or block walls from water damage and extend their life. We\u2019ll also share what tools and materials you need, and how to get the best results. If you find this guide helpful, please like and follow for more practical construction tips. Contractors, don\u2019t forget to check out Contractor Plus\u2014the ultimate operating system for build and service contractors!",
