      name: "How to Install a New Lawn: Step-by-Step Guide",
      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to install new lawn at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/install-new-lawn/national-average\n\nReady for a fresh, green yard? This video shows you exactly how to install a new lawn, step by step. Learn how to prepare your site, improve your soil, lay sod or seed, and care for your new grass for the best results. We cover everything from clearing old grass to watering tips, so you can avoid common mistakes and get a healthy, even lawn. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, these tips will help you save time and money. Have questions or want to share your own lawn tips? Drop a comment below! Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more how-to guides. Contractors\u2014discover how Contractor Plus can help you run your business smarter.",
