      name: "How to Start Up Your Sprinkler System for Spring",
      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to sprinkler system startup at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/sprinkler-system-startup/national-average\n\nIn this video, we show you exactly how to start up your sprinkler system for the season. Learn how to inspect your system for damage, clear debris, and make quick repairs with the right materials. We\u2019ll guide you through safely pressurizing your system, testing each zone for leaks and coverage, and adjusting your controller for the perfect watering schedule. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, these steps will help you avoid costly mistakes and keep your lawn healthy. Like and follow for more tips, and let us know your questions or experiences in the comments!",
