      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to move light switch at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/move-light-switch/national-average\n\nThinking about moving a light switch? This video shows you exactly how to do it, from turning off the power to patching the drywall. We cover the tools and materials you\u2019ll need, how to plan your wiring route, and the safest way to reroute wires. Whether you\u2019re a DIY homeowner or a contractor, you\u2019ll get clear, simple steps to move a light switch like a pro. Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more helpful tips! Contractors\u2014discover how Contractor Plus can help you run your business smarter. Drop your questions or experiences in the comments below!",
