      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to masonry caulking at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/masonry-caulking/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn how to caulk masonry joints step-by-step for a professional, watertight finish. We cover everything from surface prep and taping to applying caulk and ensuring a clean, durable seal. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner tackling a DIY project or a contractor looking for best practices, this guide will help you get the job done right. Discover tips for using backer rods, getting smooth lines, and making sure your caulk lasts. If you found this helpful, hit like and follow for more construction tips. Contractors\u2014don\u2019t forget to check out Contractor Plus for the ultimate contractor operating system!",
