        "Calculate materials & costs to main breaker panel replacement at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/main-breaker-panel-replacement/national-average\n\nIn this video, we break down the full process of replacing a 200-amp main breaker panel, including all the materials you'll need and the key steps to do the job right. You'll learn how to safely shut down power, remove the old panel, install the new one, and pass inspection. We cover labeling circuits, disconnecting wires, grounding, and following local codes. Whether you're a contractor or a homeowner, this guide will help you understand what to expect and how to prepare. Got questions or tips? Drop them in the comments! Like and follow for more pro construction guides, and check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your contracting business.",
