      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to water heater leak repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/water-heater-leak-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, we show you exactly how to repair a leaking water heater, from shutting off utilities to making the right repairs and testing your work. You\u2019ll learn how to safely drain your tank, identify the source of the leak, replace faulty parts like valves or hoses, and restore your water heater to full working order. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, these clear steps will help you tackle water heater leaks with confidence. Have questions or tips? Drop them in the comments! Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more practical repair guides. Contractors\u2014discover how Contractor Plus can streamline your business today!",
