      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to tree pest control at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/tree-pest-control/national-average\n\nIn this video, we show you exactly how to control pests on your trees, from inspection to treatment and follow-up. Learn how to spot pest damage, choose the right insecticide, and apply it safely using the right equipment and protective gear. We\u2019ll also cover how to monitor your trees after treatment and what to do if pests return. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, these clear steps will help you protect your trees and keep your landscape healthy. Have questions or tips? Drop them in the comments, and don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more practical guides!",
