      name: "How to Install Concrete Fence Posts: Step-by-Step Guide",
      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to concrete fence post installation at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/concrete-fence-post-installation/national-average\n\nIn this video, we walk you through the entire process of installing concrete fence posts, from marking your fence line to setting posts in concrete and ensuring a long-lasting, sturdy result. You'll learn how to measure and space your posts, dig proper holes, use gravel for drainage, mix and pour concrete, and brace your posts for a perfect finish. Whether you're a homeowner tackling a DIY project or a contractor looking for a reliable method, this guide covers all the essential steps and tips for success. Have questions or want to share your own tips? Drop a comment below! Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more practical construction guides.",
      thumbnailUrl:
        "https://contractor-plus-website.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/og-images/c48c752c-35ba-4bb9-80e8-521119a0d816.jpg",
