      name: "How to Repair a Galvanized Pipe: Step-by-Step Guide",
      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to galvanized pipe repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/galvanized-pipe-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, we show you exactly how to repair a damaged galvanized steel pipe, from shutting off the water to installing a new section and testing for leaks. You'll learn what tools and materials you need, how to safely cut and remove the old pipe, and how to make leak-free connections with new galvanized pipe and couplings. Whether you're a homeowner tackling a DIY fix or a contractor looking for a quick refresher, this guide covers every step clearly and simply. Have questions or tips? Drop them in the comments! Like and follow for more practical repair guides, and check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your contracting business.",
