      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to window flashing installation at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/window-flashing-installation/national-average\n\nIn this video, you\u2019ll learn how to install window flashing step by step to prevent leaks and protect your home. We\u2019ll cover everything from surface prep, applying sill and side flashing, to sealing the head flashing for a watertight finish. Whether you\u2019re a contractor or a DIY homeowner, these clear instructions will help you get professional results and avoid costly water damage. Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more expert construction tips! If you\u2019re a contractor, check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business. Drop your questions or experiences in the comments below\u2014we\u2019d love to hear from you!",
