      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to water heater expansion tank replacement at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/water-heater-expansion-tank-replacement/national-average\n\nIn this video, you\u2019ll learn how to safely and efficiently replace a water heater expansion tank. We\u2019ll cover every step, from shutting off the water and draining the system, to removing the old tank, inspecting connections, and installing the new tank with the right materials. You\u2019ll also get tips on using plumber\u2019s tape, dielectric unions, and pipe insulation for a leak-free, long-lasting result. Whether you\u2019re a DIY homeowner or a professional contractor, this guide will help you avoid common mistakes and keep your water heater running smoothly. If you found this helpful, please like and follow for more home improvement tips, and check out Contractor Plus for the best contractor tools and resources!",
