      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to concrete pool deck installation at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/concrete-pool-deck-installation/national-average\n\nThinking about a new concrete pool deck? This video walks you through every step of the installation process, from site prep and forming to pouring, finishing, and sealing. Learn what materials you need\u2014like ready-mix concrete, rebar, gravel, and sealer\u2014and how much to use for a 1,000 sq ft deck. We cover key tips for a strong, slip-resistant finish and a deck that lasts. Whether you're a homeowner or a contractor, you'll get clear, practical advice to make your project a success. Like, follow, and share your questions or experiences in the comments below!",
