      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to pipe joint repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/pipe-joint-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, you\u2019ll learn how to repair a leaking pipe joint quickly and safely, whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor. We\u2019ll walk you through every step\u2014from shutting off the water and prepping the area, to cleaning, sealing, and reassembling the joint. You\u2019ll also find out which materials you need, like pipe couplings, sealant, and clamps, and get tips for a leak-free finish. This guide is perfect for anyone looking to save money on plumbing repairs or improve their DIY skills. If you found this helpful, don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more practical repair tips. Contractors, check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business!",
