      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to emergency water line repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/emergency-water-line-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, we show you exactly how to handle an emergency water line repair, from shutting off the main valve to installing a new pipe and testing for leaks. You'll learn what tools and materials you need, how to safely remove and replace damaged pipe, and tips for making a watertight connection. Whether you're a homeowner facing a sudden leak or a contractor looking for a quick refresher, this guide will help you get the job done right. Have questions or want more tips? Drop a comment below, like, and follow for more contractor how-tos. Contractors\u2014discover how Contractor Plus can streamline your business today!",
