        "Want to keep your heating system running smooth and save on repairs? In this video, I\u2019ll show you how to do basic heating system maintenance step by step. \n\nFirst, turn off the power to your heating system. Inspect all parts for signs of wear, leaks, or rust. Don\u2019t forget to check if your thermostat is working right.\n\nNext, swap out the old air filter for a new one. Clean dust from vents and registers, and clear any debris around the unit. This helps your system breathe and work better.\n\nNow, test all safety controls and look over electrical connections for any loose wires. Add lubricant to the blower motor if needed. Finally, turn the power back on and make sure everything runs smoothly.\n\nIf you liked this video, I appreciate the like and follow. If you're a contractor, come check out Contractor Plus. We've built the ultimate operating system for build and service contractors. Thanks for watching!",
