      name: "How to Install a Concrete Walkway: Step-by-Step Guide",
      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to concrete walkway installation at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/concrete-walkway-installation/national-average\n\nIn this video, we break down the entire process of installing a concrete walkway, from site preparation to finishing touches. Learn how to mark your layout, excavate, set up forms, add a gravel base, reinforce with rebar, and pour concrete for a durable, attractive walkway. We\u2019ll also cover finishing techniques and curing tips to ensure your project lasts for years. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, these clear steps will help you get professional results. Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more how-to guides, and check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to manage your construction business!",
