      transcript:
        "Want to double your closet space in just a few hours? Today, I\u2019ll show you step-by-step how to install a closet system like a pro. \n\nFirst, measure your closet and mark where the studs are. Plan your layout to make the most of your space. Gather your closet kit, mounting hardware, wall anchors, and finishing trim.\n\nNext, clear out the closet. Take out old shelves and patch any holes. If you want, give the walls a fresh coat of paint.\n\nNow, find the studs and mark where your mounting rails or brackets will go. Use wall anchors if you can\u2019t hit a stud. Secure the hardware tightly\u2014this is what holds everything up.\n\nAssemble the shelves, rods, and drawers following the instructions. Hang each piece on the hardware you just installed. Make sure everything is level and secure.\n\nFinally, put your clothes and items back in. Adjust the shelves and rods for the best fit. Double-check that everything is sturdy and looks great.\n\nIf you liked this video, I appreciate the like and follow. If you're a contractor, come check out Contractor Plus. We've built the ultimate operating system for build and service contractors. Thanks for watching!",
