      "@type": "VideoObject",
      name: "How to Plan and Complete a Commercial Demolition",
      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to commercial demolition at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/commercial-demolition/national-average\n\nThinking about a commercial demolition project? This video breaks down the entire process, from site assessment and permitting to utility disconnection, structural demolition, and final site cleanup. Learn what materials and equipment you'll need, how long each step takes, and the best practices for safety and compliance. Whether you're a contractor or a property owner, you'll get clear, actionable tips to help you plan and manage your demolition project with confidence. Like and follow for more expert construction guides, and let us know your demolition questions in the comments!",
      thumbnailUrl:
        "https://contractor-plus-website.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/og-images/229f2256-fc2d-4b17-83d9-bce0ec3331ec.jpg",
