      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to roof underlayment replacement at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/roof-underlayment-replacement/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn how to replace your roof underlayment the right way, from removing old shingles to installing new synthetic underlayment and drip edge. We\u2019ll walk you through each step, including how to inspect and repair your roof deck, apply roof deck tape, and seal everything for maximum protection. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner tackling a DIY project or a contractor looking for a refresher, this guide covers the essentials for a leak-free, long-lasting roof. Got questions or tips? Drop them in the comments! Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more roofing and construction how-tos.",
