      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to deck joist repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/deck-joist-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn how to repair damaged deck joists and restore your deck\u2019s safety and strength. We\u2019ll walk you through inspecting for rot or damage, removing old joists, prepping the site, and installing new pressure-treated joists with the right hardware. You\u2019ll also see how to use construction adhesive and flashing tape for extra protection. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, these clear steps will help you get the job done right. Have questions or tips? Drop them in the comments! Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more practical construction guides. Contractors\u2014discover how Contractor Plus can streamline your business today!",
