      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to reverse osmosis system replacement at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/reverse-osmosis-system-replacement/national-average\n\nIn this video, we walk you through the complete process of replacing a reverse osmosis water filtration system under your sink. Learn how to safely shut off your water, remove the old system, and install a new 5-stage RO unit with all the right parts\u2014like flexible tubing, drain saddle valves, and Teflon tape. We cover every step, from mounting the new filter assembly to flushing and testing your system for leaks and water quality. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, you\u2019ll get clear, easy-to-follow instructions to ensure a smooth installation. Like and follow for more DIY and contractor tips, and check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business!",
