      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to install sink plumbing at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/install-sink-plumbing/national-average\n\nIn this video, you\u2019ll learn exactly how to install sink plumbing like a pro. We\u2019ll walk you through every step, from shutting off the water and prepping your workspace, to installing the drain, faucet, supply lines, and P-trap. You\u2019ll see which materials you need, how to make watertight connections, and how to test for leaks. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner tackling your first sink or a contractor looking for a quick refresher, this guide makes the process simple and clear. If you found this helpful, please like and follow for more DIY and contractor tips. Contractors, don\u2019t forget to check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business!",
      thumbnailUrl:
        "https://contractor-plus-website.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/og-images/28bfe0ed-fc58-4e17-9531-26dedb0d0b9c.jpg",
