      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to easement survey at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/easement-survey/national-average\n\nIn this video, we break down the full process of completing an easement survey for your property. You'll learn how to review property documents, mark boundaries and easement areas in the field, and create a detailed survey map and report. We cover the essential materials you'll need\u2014like surveyor stakes, flags, marking paint, and map printing\u2014and explain how much time to budget for each step. Whether you're a contractor or a homeowner, this guide will help you understand what goes into a professional easement survey and how to do it right. Have questions or want more tips? Drop a comment below and don't forget to subscribe for more construction how-tos!",
