      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to foundation masonry repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/foundation-masonry-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn how to repair foundation masonry the right way. We\u2019ll walk you through every step, from site prep and crack cleaning to mixing mortar, reinforcing with rebar, and applying waterproofing sealant. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, you\u2019ll get clear instructions on what materials you need, how to use them, and tips for a strong, lasting repair. Protect your property and avoid costly damage by following these proven steps. If you found this guide helpful, please like and follow for more construction tips. Contractors, don\u2019t forget to check out Contractor Plus\u2014the ultimate operating system for build and service contractors. Drop your questions or experiences in the comments below!",
