      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to brick arch repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/brick-arch-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn how to repair a brick arch from start to finish. We cover everything you need to know, from assessing damage and removing old mortar, to replacing bricks and ensuring a strong, lasting repair. You\u2019ll see which materials and tools you need, how to mix and apply mortar, and tips for matching the original look of your arch. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner tackling a DIY project or a contractor looking for a refresher, this guide will help you get professional results. Have questions or want to share your own tips? Drop a comment below and join the conversation!",
