      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to roof deck replacement at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/roof-deck-replacement/national-average\n\nIn this video, we walk you through the full process of roof deck replacement, from removing old materials to installing new plywood, underlayment, and flashing. Learn what tools and materials you\u2019ll need, how much time each step takes, and key tips for a safe, code-compliant job. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner tackling a DIY project or a contractor looking for a quick refresher, this guide covers everything you need to know. Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more expert construction tips, and let us know your questions or experiences in the comments below!",
