      name: "How to Install Cabinet Hinges Like a Pro",
      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to cabinet hinge installation at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/cabinet-hinge-installation/national-average\n\nIn this video, you'll learn how to install concealed cabinet hinges for a smooth, professional finish. We cover every step: removing old doors and hinges, marking and drilling new hinge holes, and installing and adjusting your new hinges for perfect alignment. Whether you're a homeowner updating your kitchen or a contractor looking for a quick refresher, this guide will help you get the job done right. Have questions or tips of your own? Drop them in the comments! Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more practical how-to videos. Contractors, check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business.",
