        "Calculate materials & costs to stone floor installation at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/stone-floor-installation/national-average\n\nIn this video, we walk you through the complete process of installing a stone floor, from surface prep to sealing and final inspection. Learn how to remove old flooring, prepare your subfloor, plan your tile layout, apply mortar, set stone tiles, grout, and seal for a professional finish. Whether you\u2019re a DIY homeowner or a contractor, these clear steps will help you achieve a beautiful, long-lasting stone floor. Have questions or tips? Drop them in the comments! Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more expert construction guides. Contractors\u2014discover how Contractor Plus can streamline your business today!",
