        "Calculate materials & costs to replace old windows at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/replace-old-windows/national-average\n\nThinking about replacing your old windows? This video walks you through the entire process, from prep and measurement to installing new vinyl windows and sealing them for energy efficiency. Learn how to safely remove old windows, inspect and repair framing, and install new units with proper insulation and caulking. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, you\u2019ll get clear, practical tips to make your window replacement project a success. Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more helpful guides, and let us know your questions or experiences in the comments!",
