      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to bathtub leak repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/bathtub-leak-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, you\u2019ll learn how to quickly find and repair a leaking bathtub, saving you from costly water damage. We\u2019ll walk you through inspecting your tub, identifying the leak source, removing old caulk or faulty parts, and sealing everything up with the right materials. You\u2019ll also see how to replace a drain assembly, gasket, or even a section of PVC pipe if needed. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, these clear steps will help you get the job done right. Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more home repair tips, and let us know in the comments if you have any questions or want to share your own repair stories!",
