      name: "How to Repair a Drip Irrigation System: Step-by-Step Guide",
      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to drip irrigation repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/drip-irrigation-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, we show you exactly how to repair a drip irrigation system, from inspection to testing. Learn how to spot leaks, replace damaged tubing and emitters, and make sure your system runs efficiently. We cover the essential tools and materials you\u2019ll need, including tubing, emitters, connectors, goof plugs, filters, and pressure regulators. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, these clear steps will help you save water and keep your landscape healthy. If you found this guide helpful, please like and follow for more tips. Contractors, discover how Contractor Plus can streamline your business today!",
