        "Calculate materials & costs to stone patio installation at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/stone-patio-installation/national-average\n\nReady to upgrade your outdoor space? This video walks you through every step of installing a stone patio, from site prep and base installation to laying pavers and finishing touches. Learn how to mark your patio area, excavate, lay a solid gravel and sand base, fit stone pavers, and lock everything in place with polymeric sand. We cover the tools, materials, and pro tips you need for a long-lasting, beautiful patio. Whether you\u2019re a DIY homeowner or a contractor, you\u2019ll get clear, practical advice to make your project a success. Like and follow for more how-tos, and check out Contractor Plus for the best contractor tools and resources!",
