      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to thermostat not turning on at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/thermostat-not-turning-on/national-average\n\nIs your thermostat not turning on and leaving your home uncomfortable? In this video, we walk you through the exact steps to troubleshoot and fix a thermostat that won't power up. Learn how to check for power issues, inspect your circuit breaker, adjust thermostat settings, replace batteries, and examine wiring connections safely. Whether you're a homeowner or a contractor, these clear instructions will help you get your HVAC system running again. Have questions or tips? Drop them in the comments! Like and follow for more home repair guides, and contractors\u2014discover how Contractor Plus can streamline your business today.",
