      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to concrete curbing installation at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/concrete-curbing-installation/national-average\n\nThinking about adding concrete curbing to your property? This video walks you through every step of the installation process, from site prep and forming to pouring, finishing, and cleanup. Learn how to mark your layout, dig a proper trench, set forms, reinforce with rebar, mix and pour concrete, and finish your curbing for a professional look. We\u2019ll also cover curing tips and safe cleanup. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, you\u2019ll get practical tips to make your project a success. Like and follow for more how-to guides, and let us know your questions or experiences in the comments!",
