      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to primer application at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/primer-application/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn how to apply primer for a flawless paint job, whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor. We cover everything from surface preparation and masking to applying primer and doing final touch-ups. You\u2019ll find out what materials you need, how to protect your space, and the best way to get even coverage. Follow these steps to make your next painting project easier and more professional. Got questions or tips? Drop them in the comments! Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more helpful construction guides. Contractors\u2014discover how Contractor Plus can streamline your business today!",
