      name: "How to Replace an Electric Baseboard Heater: Step-by-Step Guide",
      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to baseboard heater replacement at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/baseboard-heater-replacement/national-average\n\nIn this video, we show you exactly how to replace an old electric baseboard heater with a new one, safely and efficiently. You'll learn how to turn off the power, remove the old heater, inspect and prep wiring, mount the new unit, and connect everything for a safe installation. We cover the tools and materials you'll need, including wire connectors, electrical cable, and mounting hardware. Whether you're a homeowner looking to save on labor or a contractor wanting a quick refresher, this guide walks you through every step. Have questions or tips? Drop them in the comments! Like and follow for more DIY and contractor how-tos.",
