      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to fan balancing service at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/fan-balancing-service/national-average\n\nIs your ceiling fan shaking or making annoying noises? In this video, we show you exactly how to balance a ceiling fan using simple tools and easy steps. Learn how to inspect your fan, clean the blades, use a balancing kit, and make final adjustments for a smooth, quiet operation. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, these tips will help you get the job done right the first time. Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more helpful how-to videos, and if you\u2019re a contractor, check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business!",
