      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to main breaker replacement at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/main-breaker-replacement/national-average\n\nIn this video, we walk you through the entire process of replacing a main circuit breaker in your electrical panel. Learn how to safely power down your system, remove the old breaker, inspect for damage, and install a new 200-amp main breaker. We cover all the essential materials you\u2019ll need, including copper wire, wire connectors, and insulating tape, plus key safety tips to protect yourself. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner tackling a DIY project or a contractor looking for a refresher, this guide will help you get the job done right. Don\u2019t forget to like, follow, and check out Contractor Plus for more resources and tools for contractors!",
