      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to replace gas line at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/replace-gas-line/national-average\n\nIn this video, we walk you through the full process of replacing a gas line, from shutting off the gas and removing the old pipe, to installing new black iron gas pipes, fittings, and valves. You'll learn what materials you need, how to assemble and secure the new line, and how to safely test for leaks before restoring service. Whether you're a contractor or a handy homeowner, this guide covers the key steps and safety tips to get the job done right. Have questions or tips? Drop them in the comments! Like and follow for more how-to videos, and check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your contracting business.",
