      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to wall sconce installation at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/wall-sconce-installation/national-average\n\nIn this video, you\u2019ll learn how to install a wall sconce from start to finish. We cover everything: turning off the power, marking your placement, installing the electrical box and wiring, mounting the sconce, and testing your new light. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, these clear steps will help you get the job done safely and efficiently. Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more DIY and contractor tips! If you\u2019re a pro, check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business. Drop your questions or share your own tips in the comments below!",
