      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to garbage disposal plumbing at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/garbage-disposal-plumbing/national-average\n\nIn this video, you\u2019ll learn how to remove an old garbage disposal and install a new one, including all the plumbing connections. We\u2019ll walk you through disconnecting the old unit, mounting the new disposal, connecting the discharge tube, and making sure all pipes and fittings are leak-free. You\u2019ll also see which materials you need\u2014like PVC pipes, elbows, couplings, plumber\u2019s putty, and more\u2014so you can plan your project and budget. Whether you\u2019re a DIY homeowner or a contractor, this guide will help you get the job done right. Don\u2019t forget to like, follow, and check out Contractor Plus for more pro tips and tools!",
