      name: "How to Repair Window Condensation Step by Step",
      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to window condensation repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/window-condensation-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, we show you exactly how to repair window condensation and keep your windows clear. Learn how to inspect your windows, clean and dry the surfaces, and seal them to prevent future moisture problems. We\u2019ll also cover when and how to replace a failed insulated glass unit (IGU) using the right materials like glazing tape, setting blocks, and caulk. Plus, get tips on improving ventilation to stop condensation from coming back. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner or a contractor, these steps will help you tackle window condensation quickly and effectively. Like and follow for more home repair tips, and check out Contractor Plus for the best contractor tools and resources!",
