      name: "How to Repair a Stone Fireplace: Step-by-Step Guide",
      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to stone fireplace repair at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/stone-fireplace-repair/national-average\n\nIn this video, you\u2019ll learn how to repair a stone fireplace from start to finish. We cover everything: assessing damage, removing old mortar and stones, mixing and applying new mortar, resetting stones, replacing firebricks, and sealing your work for a lasting finish. Whether you\u2019re a homeowner tackling a DIY project or a contractor looking for a refresher, this guide breaks down each step in simple, easy-to-follow language. Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more helpful construction tips! If you\u2019re a contractor, check out Contractor Plus for the best tools to run your business. Drop your questions or share your fireplace repair stories in the comments below!",
