      description:
        "Calculate materials & costs to trim replacement at https://contractorplus.app/resources/contractor-costs/trim-replacement/national-average\n\nIn this video, learn how to replace baseboard or casing trim in your home from start to finish. We\u2019ll cover removing old trim, measuring and cutting new pieces, installing with finishing nails, and adding the perfect finishing touches with caulk and paint. Whether you\u2019re a DIY homeowner or a contractor looking for a quick refresher, this guide breaks down each step so you can get professional results. Have questions or tips to share? Drop them in the comments! Don\u2019t forget to like and follow for more home improvement tutorials. Contractors\u2014discover how Contractor Plus can help you run your business smarter!",
